<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">Joshua</book>
  <para style="h">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joshua</para>
  <para style="mt">Joshua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa sal Moses thih hnuah, Moses rianṭuantu Joshua, Nun fapa cu, Bawipa nih a chawnh i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka sal Moses cu a thi cang; cucaah nangmah le hi mi vialte hna hi tho u law, hi Jordan tiva hi tan u law, anmah, Israel mi hna ka pek laimi ram chungah cun lut tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nan keza nih a lamh laimi hmun paoh cu, Moses sinah bia ka rak kam bang khan, nanmah kan pek cang hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ramlak le hi Lebanon tlang in tiva ngan Zufrates tiang, Hit mi hna ram vialte nitlaknak leiah Rili Ngan tiang; nan ram a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nunchung vialte ahohmanh na hmai i a dir khomi an um lai lo; Moses sinah ka um bang khan, nangmah sin zongah ka um lai; kan deuh lai lo i kan hlaw fawn lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭhawng ngai le ralṭha ngaiin um tuah; zeitintiah an pupa hna sinah pek awkin chiat ka rak ser cangmi ram hi, hi mi hi na coter hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moses ka sal nih nawl an pekmi phungbia vialte ningin ralring tein tuah awkah, a ṭhawn bel ṭhawng ngai le ralṭha ngaiin um ko; khuazei ka na kalnak hmanh ah khuaawng na pemh nakhnga, orhlei ah siseh kehlei ah siseh i mer hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi phungbia cauk nih hin na kaa kha chuahtak hlah seh; sihmanhsehlaw a chungah aa ṭialmi vialte ningin tuah awkah ralring tein na um nakhnga, chunzan in mah cucu na ruat lai; zeitintiah khi tikah na lam kha na tluanter lai i khi tikah khua awng na tong lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keimah nih nawl kan pek a si lo mei? Ṭhawng ngai le ralṭha ngaiin um ko; na thinphang hlah, na lung zong dong hlah; zeicahtiah Bawipa na Pathian cu khuazeika na kalnak hmanh ah na sinah a um ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih mi zapi chung i an bawi hna cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Riahhmun chungah khan i chawk u law, mi zapi kha, ‘Riahcaw i tim tuah u; zeitintiah ni thum chungah, Bawipa nan Pathian nih co awkah an pekmi hna ram cu va co awkah hi Jordan hi nan tan lai,’ tiah chim hna u,” tiah nawl a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu hna sinah khan Joshua nih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Bawipa sal Moses nih, ‘ Bawipa nan Pathian nih dinhnak hmun an pek hna i hi ram hi an pek hna lai,’ tiin nawl an pekmi hna kha i cinken tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nan nupile hna le nan fale hna le nan saṭil cu Jordan tiva ral Moses nih an pekmi hna ram ah hin an rung tang lai; sihmanhsehlaw nannih lak i miralṭha vialte cu ralthuam in i thuam in, nan unau hna hmaiah nan kai lai i nan bawmh hna lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa nih nan unau hna cu nanmah bantukin dinhnak a pek hna i Bawipa nan Pathian nih a pek liomi hna ram cu annih zong nih an co hlantiang nan bawmh hna lai. Cun Bawipa sal Moses nih a pekmi hna Jordan ral nichuahlei kam i a ummi ram, nanmah ta a simi ram ah cun, nan kir lai i nan co lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu an leh i, “Nawl na kan pekmi paohpaoh cu kan tuah lai i khuazei hmanh ah na kan thlahnak paoh ah kan kal lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Moses kha zeizong vialte ah a bia kan ngaih bantuk tein nangmah bia zong kan ngaih lai; amah belte, Bawipa na Pathian cu Moses sinah a rak um bang khan na sinah um ve ko seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zei na fial paoh ah na nawlbia kha a ralchanh i na bia kha a almi cu ahohmanh thah a si lai. A ṭhawn bel ṭhawng law, ralṭha ngaiin um ko,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Nun fapa Joshua nih Shittim in a thli tein mi pahnih ram ngiatu ah a thlah hna i, “Va kal u law ram kha va cuan tuah u, Jeriko ko kha,” tiah a ti. Cun an kal i Rahab a min a simi hlawhhlangnu inn ah an lut i khika ah an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Jeriko siangpahrang cu, “Zohhmanh, ram ngiatthlai awkah Israel mi tuzan ah hika ah an ra,” tiah an chimh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Jeriko siangpahrang nih Rahab sinah cun mi a hei thlah hna i, “Na sinah a rami, na inn chungah a lutmi kha rak chuahpi hna; zeicahtiah ram vialte kha ngiatthlai awkah a rami an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw minu nih cun mipa pahnih hna cu a rak lak hna i a rak thuh hna i, “Biatak a si, ka sinah mi cu an ra ko, sihmanhsehlaw khuazei in an rat cu ka hngal lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cun kutka khar a si deng, mui ah khan, mi hna cu an chuak; khuazei ah dah mi hna cu an kal ka hngal lo; khulrang in dawi tuah hna u, nan phak ko hna lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw inncung ah a kaipi hna i a tianmi khumkung lakah khan a thuh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cucaah mi nih cun Jordan tiva lei lam ah khan ti tannak hmun tiangin an dawi hna i, a dawitu hna kha an chuah cangka tein kutka kha an khar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An ih hlanah, an sinah inncung ah cun nu cu a hung kai i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi hna sinah cun, “ Bawipa nih hi ram kha an pek cang hna i nanmah kan in ṭihnak hna nih khan a kan nenh i hi ram chung ummi vialte kha nan hmaiah an ther dih cang, ti kha ka hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zeitintiah Izipt ram in nan chuah tikah zeitindah Bawipa nih nan hmaiah Rili Sen ti kha a carter i zeitindah Jordan tiva ral ah a ummi Amor mi siangpahrang pahnih Sihon le Og kha nan hrawh cikcek hna kha kan theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun cucu kan theih cangka tein kan lung cu an ther i nanmah ruangah ahohmanh ralṭha an um ti lo; zeitintiah cunglei van le tanglei vawlei i Pathian a simi cu Bawipa nan Pathian kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cucaah atu cu, nan cungah zaangfahnak ka langhter cang bantukin, nannih zong nih ka pa innchungkhar cungah zaangfahnak nan langhter ve i, hmelchunhnak taktak nan ka pek i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cun ka pa le ka nu, ka ṭale le ka unau hna le anmah ta a simi vialte cu nan khamh hna i kan nunnak kha thihnak chungin nan kan chuah naklai, Bawipa min in ka sinah chiatser tuah u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun mi hna nih cun a sinah, “Kan nun ah nan nung ve lai! Hi kan rian hi na chim lo ahcun, Bawipa nih hi ram kha a kan pek tikah zaangfahnak te le zumh awk tlak tein kan in ti lai,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun thlalangawng in hri in a vun thlak hna, zeitintiah a inn cu khua kulhnak ralhau chungah sak chih a si caah amah cu ralhau chungah khan a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun anih nih, “An dawitu hna nih an in ton sualnak hna hnga lo, tlang ah hung kai u; cun an dawitu hna an kir hlantiang, ni thum in cuka ah cun hung i thup u; cu hnuah cun va lan te ko u,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi hna nih khan, “Chiat na kan sertermi lawng hin cun mawhchiat kan si hnga lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zohhmanh, ram chungah kan rung luh tikah hi hri sen hi na kan chuahternak thlalangawng ah hin na rak hren lai, cun na inn chungah hin na pa le na nu, na ṭale le na pa innchungkhar vialte nan rak pumh hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na innka in khuachung lam ah ahohmanh an chuah ahcun a thi cu amah lu cungah a si lai i, kannih cu mawhchiat awk kan si lai lo; sihmanhsehlaw na inn chung i a ummi aho cung hmanh ah kut thlak a si ahcun, a thi cu kan lu cungah a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw kan rian hi na chim ahcun, chiat na kan sertermi biakamnak ah hin kannih cu mawhchiat awk kan si hnga lo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun anih nih, “Nan bia bangin si ko seh,” tiah a ti. Cun a kalter hna i an kal; cun hri sen kha thlalangawng ah khan a hren.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An kal i tlang ah cun an hung kal, a dawitu hna an kir hlantiang, khika ah ni thum an um; a dawitu hna nih khan lam thluanchuak in an kawl hna, sihmanhsehlaw zeihmanh an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun mi pahnih hna kha tlang cung cun an rung ṭum ṭhan i tiva cu an tan i Nun fapa Joshua sinah khan an ra; cun an cung i thil a tlungmi vialte kha an chimh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun annih nih Joshua sinah, “ Bawipa nih ram cu a dihlak in kan kut chungah a kan pek taktak ko cang; cu hleiah cu ram chung ummi vialte hna cu kanmah ruangah an therphang ko,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zingka tein Joshua cu a tho i Shittim in Israel mi vialte he an i thawh; cun Jordan kha an phan i an tan hlanah khika ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni thum hnuah riahhmun chungah cun bawi hna kha an i chawk i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mi kha, “ Bawipa nan Pathian biakamnak kuang kha Levi tlangbawi pawl nih an put kha nan hmuh tikah, nan umnak cio khan nan i thawh lai i nan zulh lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />zeitintiah hi leiah cu hlan cu nan kal bal lo caah nan kalnak ding lam cu an hmuhsak hna a hau lai. Asinain nanmah le a karlak cu dong thong hnih tluk in aa hlat lai; nan naih lai lo,” tiah nawl an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih mi zapi hna cu, “ Bawipa nih thaizing ah nan lakah khuaruahhar a tuah lai caah i thianh tuah u,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih tlangbawi hna cu, “Biakamnak kuang kha i lak u law, mi zapi hmaiah lan tuah u,” tiah a ti hna. Cun biakamnak kuang cu an i lak i mi zapi hmaiah cun an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i, “Nihin ah hin nangmah cu Israel mi vialte mithmuh ah hlorh hram kan thawk lai, zeitintiah annih nih, Moses sinah ka rak um bang khan, nangmah sinah ka um ve lai, ti kha an hngalh nakhnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun biakamnak kuang a putu tlangbawi hna cu, ‘Jordan ti kam nan phak tikah Jordan tiva chungah cun nan dir peng lai,’ tiin nawl na pek hna lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih Israel mi hna cu, “Hika ah hin ra u law, Bawipa nan Pathian bia kha thei tuah u,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih, “Mah hi hin Pathian nung cu nan lakah a um i, amah nih pel lo tein nan hmai in Kanaan mi hna le Hit mi hna le Hiv mi hna le Periz mi hna le Girgash mi hna le Amor mi hna le Jebus mi hna cu a dawi hna lai, ti kha hngal ko u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zohhmanh u, vawleicung dihlak Bawipa i biakamnak kuang nih nannih hmaiah Jordan tiva a tan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cucaah Israel miphun hna chungin mi hleihnih, phun khat chungin mi pakhat cio, nan lak hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Bawipa, vawlei cung dihlak i Bawipa a simi, a kuang putu tlangbawi hna keza nih Jordan ti a lamh tikah, Jordan ti cu a cat lai i cunglei in a rungmi ti cu bu khat ah an dir lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah, mi hmai i biakamnak kuang a putu tlangbawi hna he Jordan tiva tan awkah mi nih an thlam in an i thawh tikah le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kuang a putu hna nih Jordan tiva kha an phak i kuang a putu tlangbawi hna ke cu ti chungah aa hnei tikah (rawl ṭuan caan chung cu Jordan tiva hi a kuang a liam ko),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />cunglei in a rungmi ti kha an dir i lam hlatpi ah Zarethan ram pawng i a ummi khua Adam ah cun a bu in an dir i, Arabah rili, Cite Rili lei i a vung luangmi cu an cat dih; cun Jeriko khua zawn cun mi nih cun an tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Israel mi vialte nih leiro cungin an tan lioah, Jordan tiva chungah cun, Bawipa biakamnak kuang a zawntu tlangbawi hna kha, an phun ning piin Jordan tiva cu an tan dih hlantiang, leiro cungah cun an dir.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />An phun ning piin Jordan tiva kha an tan dih tikah, Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mi zapi chungin mi hleihnih, phun khat in pakhat cio, la hna law,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Hika hin, Jordan tiva chung hin, tlangbawi hna ke a dirnak hmun thengte khan, lung hleihnih in la u law, i put hna u law, tuzan i nan riahnak hmun ah chia hna u,’ tiah nawl pe hna,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih Israel mi chungin mi hlei hnih hna cu, phun khat in pakhat cio a thimmi hna cu, a kawh hna i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joshua nih an sinah, “ Bawipa nan Pathian kuang hmaiah cun Jordan tiva laifang ah khan nan va kal lai i Israel mi phun zat in, nan liang in pakhat nih lung pakhat cio nan put lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />cun hmailei caan ah nan tefa hna nih, ‘Hi lung hna hi nan caah zei sullam dah an si?’ tiah an in hal tik hna ah, mah hihi nan lakah hmelchunhnak a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khi tikah nannih nih Bawipa biakamnak kuang hmaiah Jordan tiva ti cu a cat; Jordan kha a tan tikah Jordan ti cu a cat, tiah nan chimh hna lai. Cucaah hi lung hna cu Israel mi caah zungzal hngalh camcinnak an si lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Israel mi hna nih cun Joshua nih nawl a pek hna bangin an tuah, Bawipa nih Joshua a chimh bang khan, Jordan tiva chungin, Israel miphun zat in, lung hleihnih cu an lak i an riahnak hmun ah an i kalpi hna i khika ah an chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih Jordan tiva laifang, biakamnak kuang a putu tlangbawi hna ke dirnak hmun ah khan, lung pahleihnih a bunh hna i khika ah nihin ni tiangin an um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses nih Joshua nawl a rak pekmi vialte bangin Bawipa nih Joshua cu mi zapi kha chimh hna awkah nawl a pekmi vialte a dih hlantiang, kuang a zawntu tlangbawi hna cu Jordan tiva chungah an dir. Mi zapi nih cun hnawhnam in an tan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />cun mi vialte nih cun an tan dih tikah Bawipa biakamnak kuang le tlangbawi hna cu zapi hmaiah cun an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Reuben fapa hna le Gad fapa hna le Manasseh phun cheu hna kha Moses nih a rak chimh hna bang khan Israel mi hmaiah cun hriamnam i ken in an kal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ral doh dingah timh cia tein ralthuam in aa thuammi mi sang li tluk, Bawipa hmaiah ral doh awkah, Jeriko nelrawn leiah cun an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khi ni ah Bawipa nih Joshua cu Israel mi vialte hmaiah a hlorh i Moses an rak ṭihzah bantuk khan amah cu a chan chung vialte an ṭihzah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hngalhternak bia kuang a zawntu tlangbawi hna kha Jordan in hung chuah awkah nawl pe hna,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih tlangbawi hna cu, “Jordan tiva in hung chuak u,” tiah nawl a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Bawipa biakamnak kuang a zawntu tlangbawi hna kha Jordan tiva chungin an chuah i tlangbawi hna keza nih cun lei ro a tawngh tikah, Jordan tiva ti cu an umnak ah an kir ṭhan i hmasa bantuk khan a kuang cu a liam ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thla hmasa bik thla, a ni hra ni ah, mi hna cu Jordan in an hung chuak i Jeriko nichuahlei ramri i a ummi Gilgal ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Jordan chungin an lakmi lung hleihnih hna kha Joshua nih Gilgal ah a phun hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Israel mi hna sinah cun, “Hmailei caan ah nan fale hna nih an pale hna cu, ‘Hi lung hi zei sullam dah an si?” tiah an hal tik hna ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />khi tikah nan fale hna cu, ‘Israel mi nih hi. Jordan hi vawlei ro cungin an rak tan,’ tiah nan hngalhter hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian nih kan tan dih hlantiang kan caah a cartermi Rili Sen cungah a tuah bang khan, Jordan tiva ti cu nan tan dih hlantiang a carter,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />zeitintiah vawlei cung mi vialte nih Bawipa kut cu a ṭhawng ti kha an hngalh nakhnga le Bawipa nan Pathian cu zungzal in nan ṭih nakhnga,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan khattelei ral nitlaklei i a ummi Amor mi hna siangpahrang vialte le rili pawngah a ummi Kanaan mi siangpahrang vialte nih Israel mi caah an tan dih hlantiang Jordan tiva ti cu Bawipa nih a kaoter tiah an theih tikah, Israel mi hna ruangah cun an thin a phang i an chungah thlarau zeihmanh a um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khi caan ah Bawipa nih Joshua cu, “Ṭeklung namte ser hna law, Israel mi cu a voi hnihnak an cuarpar tan ṭhan hna,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih ṭeklung namte cu a ser hna i Gibeath-haaraloth ah Israel mi cu an cuarpar a tan hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun mah hihi Joshua nih zei ruangah dah an cuarpar a tan hnanak cu a si: Izipt ram in a chuakmi pa vialte, ralkap vialte kha Izipt ram in an chuah hnuah ramlak ah khan lampi ah an thi dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chuakmi pa vialte kha cuarpar tan an rak si nain, Izipt ram i an chuah hnu ramlak i lampi ah a chuakmi vialte hna tu kha cu cuarpar tan lo an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa aw kha an rak ngaih lo caah, an phun ningin, Izipt ram in a chuakmi ralkap vialte, an rawh dih hlantiang, Israel mi hna cu ramlak ah khan kum sawm li an rak vai; kannih pek awkah Bawipa nih kan pupa hna sinah chiat a sermi, cawhnuk le khuaihliti in a luangmi ram kha annih nih hmu lo dingin annih sinah Bawipa nih chiat a ser.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih an cuarpar a tanmi hna cu anmah can ah Pathian nih a dirhmi an fale hna kha an si; lampi ah cuarpartan lo an rak si caah khan cuarpar tan loin an rak um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An phun ningin an cuarpar tannak a dih tikah, an dam tiang riahhmun i an umnak cio ah cun an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Joshua sinah cun, “Nihin ni ah hin nan sinin Izipt mi nih an in nihsawh hnanak cu ka hrilh cang,” tiah a ti. Cucaah cu ka hmun min cu nihin tiangin Gilgal ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mi hna cu Gilgal i an riah lioah, Jeriko nelrawn ah cun, cu thla ni hleili ni zanlei ah lanhtak puai kha an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun lanhtak puai a thaizing, cu ni hrimhrim ah cun, cu ram in a chuakmi, thilnu cawh lo chang le vaireu kha an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun cu ram in a chuakmi an ei tikah, a thaizing in manna kha a dong i Israel mi nih manna kha an ngei ti lo; sihmanhsehlaw cu kum ah cun Kanaan ram in a chuakmi thil kha an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joshua cu Jeriko khua pawngah a um tikah a mit a hun hler i a hun zoh i, zohhmanh, a hmaiah mipa pakhat a vainam zuh cia in a dir; Joshua cu a sinah a va kal i amah cu, “Kanmah caah maw na si, kan ral hna caah dah na si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun anih nih, “Sihlah; sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa ralkapbu hruitu in ka ra,” tiah a ti. Cun Joshua cu vawlei ah a bawk i a biak i, “Ka bawipa nih a salpa a fialmi cu zeidah a si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Bawipa ralkapbu hruitu nih cun Joshua sinah cun, “Na kedan kha i phoih hna; zeicahtiah na dirnak kha hmun thiang a si,” tiah a ti. Cun cu bangin Joshua nih a tuah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeriko khua cu a chunglei he a lenglei he Israel mi hna ruangah cun aa khar khipkhep ko; ahohmanh a chuak a lut an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i, “Zohhmanh, Jeriko cu a siangpahrang he, a miṭhawng ralṭha hna he tiah, na kut chungah kan pek cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khua cu nan vel lai, ralkap vialte nih chel khat an vel lai. Cu bantukin ni ruk nan tuah lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun tlangbawi pasarih nih tuukawng ki muko pasarih kuang hmaiah cun an i put lai; cun ni sarihnak ni ah cun khua cu voi sarih nan vel lai, tlangbawi nih muko cu an tum hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun tuukawng ki cu an tum vuaimai tikah, muko aw thawng cu nan theih cangka in mi vialte cu fak piin nan au lai; cun khua kulhnak ralhau cu a tlu lai i mi zapi cu anmah le an hmai zawn cio ah khan ding tein an kal lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cucaah Nun fapa Joshua nih cun tlangbawi cu a auh hna i, “Biakamnak kuang kha i lak u law, Bawipa biakamnak kuang hmaiah khan tlangbawi pasarih nih tuukawng ki muko pasarih i put hna seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun mi zapi sinah cun, “Hmaiah kal u; khua kha vel u law, hriam pumi pa kha Bawipa kuang hmaiah lanhter hna u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih mi zapi cu nawl a pek hna bangin, tlangbawi pasarih, tuukawng ki muko pasarih Bawipa hmai i aa putmi hna cu, muko cu tumpah in a hmaiah an kal i Bawipa biakamnak kuang nih cun a zulh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun muko a tumtu tlangbawi hna hmaiah cun ralthuam in aa thuammi kha an kal i muko an tumpah lengmang lioah cun, hnulei ralveng hna nih cun kuang kha an hun zulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Joshua nih mi hna kha, “Au u, tiah kan ti hna ni hlantiang nan au lai lo, nan aw zong theih awk nan siter lai lo, nan kaa zongin zei bia hmanh nan chuahter lai lo,” tiah nawl a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa kuang cu khua kha chel khat a velter i riahhmun ah an ra i riahhmun ah cun an riak ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu zingka tein a tho i tlangbawi hna nih Bawipa kuang kha an zawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun tlangbawi pasarih Bawipa hmai i tuukawng ki muko pasarih aa putmi hna kha muko hna cu tum pah lengmang in an kal; cun ralthuam in aa thuammi kha an hmaiah an kal i hnulei ralveng hna cu Bawipa kuang hnulei in an ra, tlangbawi hna nih an kalpah in muko cu an tum lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun a ni hnihnak ni ah cun khua cu chel khat an vel i riahhmun ah an kir ṭhan. Cu bantukin ni ruk an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sarihnak ni ah cun zingka tein khuafing cah ah an tho i khua cu cu bantuk ṭhiamṭhiam in chel sarih an vel; cu ni lawngah khua chel sarih an vel cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun a voi sarihnak ah cun, tlangbawi nih muko an tum tikah khan, Joshua nih mi zapi hna sinah cun, “Au tuah u; zeitintiah Bawipa nih khua cu an pek cang hna,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Cun khua cu le a chung i a ummi thil vialte cu hrawh awkah Bawipa sinah pekchanh an si lai; kannih nih kan thlahmi lamkaltu hna kha a rak thuh hna caah Rahab le amah he a inn chungah a ummi vialte cu an nung lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw hrawh awkah pekchanh ciami thil kha nannih nih nan ulh hna lai, cu ti a si lo ahcun, nannih nih nan pekchanh hna tikah khan pekchanhmi thil pakhatkhat kha nan lak sual hnga i Israel riahhmun cu hrawh awk ca thil ah nan ser hnga i a cungah harnak nan tlunter sual hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw sui le ngun vialte le thir le dar umkheng hna cu Bawipa ca thil thiang an si lai; Bawipa chawva chungah an lut ve lai,” tiah a ti
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cucaah mi cu an au i muko cu tum an si. Mi nih muko thawng kha an theih cangka tein, mi cu fak piin an au i ralhau cu a tlu, cu caah anmah le an hmai zawn cio khan mi cu khua chungah cun an hung lut i khua cu an lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun khua chungah a ummi vialte cu, nu he pa he, tar he no he, cawtum, tuu le laa he tiah vainam in an sam dih cikcek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih ram a va ngiatu mi pahnih hna sinah khan, “Hlawhhlangnu inn chungah khan va kal u law, minu cu le amah ta a simi vialte cu a sinah chiat nan rak ser bang khan hun chuahpi hna u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cucaah thlingthlatu a rak simi tlangval hna nih khan an va lut i Rahab le a pa le a nu le a ṭale hna le amah ta a simi vialte kha an chuahpi hna; cun a rualchan vialte kha an chuahpi hna i Israel riahhmun lengah an chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun khua cu mei in an khangh, a chung i a ummi thil vialte he; sui le ngun, thir le dar umkheng belte Bawipa inn chawva sinah an chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw hlawhhlangnu Rahab le a pa innchungkhar le amah ta a simi vialte cu Joshua nih a nung in a zuah hna i, Joshua nih Jeriko ngiatthlai awkah a thlahmi lamkaltu hna kha a rak thuh hna caah Israel chungah nihin ni tiang hin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khi tikah Joshua nih chiatser in, “A tho i hi Jeriko khua a sa ṭhanmi cu Bawipa hmaiah chiatserh si seh. A fater luhloh in a hram lung cu a phum lai i A fapa hniang bik luhloh in a kutka cu a bunh hna lai,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa cu Joshua sinah a um i cu ram chung vialte ah cun a min a thang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw pekchanhmi thil kongah cun Israel mi cu zumhawktlak loin an um ai; zeitintiah Judah phun chungmi Zerah fapa Zabdi fapa Karmi fapa Akhan nih pekchanhmi thil cu tlawmpal a lak i Bawipa thinhunnak cu Israel mi cungah a alh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua nih Jeriko in Bethel nichuahlei i a ummi Beth-aven pawng i a ummi Ai khua ah mi a hei thlah hna i, “Hung kal u law, ram cu hung thlingthla tuah u,” tiah a ti hna. Cun mi cu an hung kal i Ai cu an hung ngiatthlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Joshua sinah an rung kir i a sinah, “Mi vialte cu kalter hna hlah, sihmanhsehlaw thong hnih thong thum tluk hung kal hna seh law, Ai cu hung chim hna seh; mi zapi cu an ning piin khika ah an re hung theihter awk a si lo, zeicahtiah tlawmte lawng an si ko,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cucaah mi zapi chungin thong thum tluk an hung kal i Ai khuami hna hmaiah an zam len ai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cun Ai khuami nih sawm thum le paruk tluk an rak thah hna i kutka hmailei ah Shebarim tiangin an dawi hna i zuanchuknak ah khan an thah hna. Cun mi zapi cu an thin a phang i ti bantuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khi tikah Joshua nih a puan kha a thleh hna i Bawipa kuang hmaiah cun zanlei tiang vawlei ah a bawk, amah le Israel upa hna cu an bawk; cun an lu ah leidip an i phulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih, “Aize, maw Bawipa Pathian, kannih cu hrawh awk men i Amor mi kut chung i pek awkah zeicahdah hi mi hna cu Jordan tiva ral ah na kalpi hna? Jordan tiva ral i khua rak sak kha kan lung rak tling ko seh law mu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, hi bantukin an ral hna hmaiah Israel mi an zaam tikah hin zeidah ka chim khawh hnga!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zeitintiah Kanaan mi hna le hi ram chung i a ummi vialte nih an theih lai i an kan kulh lai i vawlei cung hin kan min an hloh lai; na min lianngan cu zeidah na tuahpiak lai?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i, “Tho tuah, zeicahdah na bawh ko?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel nih a sual cang; nawl ka pekmi hna ka biakamnak cu an buar cang; pekchanhmi thil cu tlawmpal an i lak; an fir i lih an chim i an thil sinah an chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cucaah Israel mi nih an ral hna hmaiah an dir kho lo; annih cu hrawh awk thil ah khan an i can caah an ral hna hmaiah an zaam. Nan lak in pekchanhmi thil kha nan hrawh lo ahcun nan sinah ka um ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tho law, mi zapi kha thianter hna, ‘Thaizing ah i thianh u, zeicahtiah Bawipa, Israel Pathian nih, “Maw Israel, nannih lakah pekchanhmi thil an um, nannih lak in cu pekchanhmi thil cu nan hlonh hna hlantiang nan ral hna hmaiah nan dir kho lai lo,” tiah hi bangin a ti,” tiah chim hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah zinglei ah nan phun nan phun in a naih ah ratpi nan si lai; cun Bawipa nih a lakmi phun cu nan chung nan chung in a naih ah nan ra lai; cun Bawipa nih a lakmi innchungkhar cu a mi a mi in a naih ah nan ra lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa biakamnak cu a buar i Israel mi lakah ningzah awk a simi thil a tuah caah, pekchanhmi thil a rak lami cu, amah he a ngeihmi vialte he, mei in khangh a si lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua cu zingka tein a tho i Israel cu an phun an phun cio ah a naih ah a ratpi hna i Judah phun cu lak a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />cun Judah innchungkhar hna cu a naih ah a ratpi hna i Zerah innchungkhar cu lak a si; cun Zerah innchungkhar cu a mi a mi in a naih ah a ratpi hna i Zabdi cu lak a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />cun amah nih amah innchungkhar cu a mi a mi in a naih ah a ratpi hna i Judah phun Zerah fapa Zabdi fapa Karmi fapa Akhan cu lak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khi tikah Joshua nih Akhan sinah cun, “Ka fapa, Bawipa Israel Pathian sinah sunparnak pe law, amah cu thangṭhat tuah; na tuahmi kha ka chim tuah; ka sinin thup hlah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Akhan nih Joshua cu a leh i, “Biangai tein Bawipa Israel Pathian cungah ka sual cang i mah hihi ka tuahmi cu a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hranchaw lakah khan Shinar puan aa dawh ngaimi le ngun shekel za hnih le sui tlang khat, shekel sawm nga a ritmi ka hmuh hna tikah ka mit an thi i ka lak hna; cun zohhmanh, ka thlam chung vawlei chungah ka thuh hna, ngun cu a tang bik ah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih lamkal a hei thlah hna i thlam ah cun an va tli i zohhmanh, thlam chungah cun a rak thuh taktak ko, a tang bik ah ngun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun thlam chung cun an lak hna i Joshua le Israel mi vialte sinah an ratpi; cun Bawipa hmaiah an chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun Joshua le Israel mi vialte nih Zerah fapa Akhan cu le ngun cu le puan cu le sui tlang cu le a fapa hna le a fanu hna le, a cawtum hna le a laa hna le a tuu hna le a thlam le a ngeihmi vialte cu an lak hna i Akhor Nelrawn ah an hun kalpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih, “Zeicahdah kan cungah harnak na tlunter? Nihin ah Bawipa nih na cungah harnak a tlunter ve,” tiah a ti. Cun Israel mi vialte nih lung in an cheh; mei in an khangh hna i lung in an cheh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun nihin tiangin a ummi lungpumh nganpi pakhat a cungah cun an pumh; cun Bawipa cu a kangh in a kangmi a thinhunnak cun aa mer. Cucaah cun nihin tiangin cu ka hmun cu Akhor Nelrawn tiah ti a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i, “Ṭih hlah, na lung zong dong hlah; ralkap vialte kha i lak hna law, tho law, Ai ah cun hung kal tuah; zohhmanh, Ai khua siangpahrang cu a mi he a khua he a ram he na kut chungah kan pek cang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />cun Ai khua le a siangpahrang cungah Jeriko khua le a siangpahrang cung i na tuah bantuk khan na tuah lai; a hranchaw le a saṭil hna cu nanmah ca i hranchaw ah nan i lak hna lai; khua cu a hnulei in lamhruang va at u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah Ai i hung kal awkah Joshua le ralkap vialte cu an tho; cun Joshua nih ralṭhami miṭhawng sang thum a thim hna i zan ah a thlah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun hitin nawl a pek hna, “Zohhmanh u, khua cu a hnulei in lamhruang nan ah lai; khua cun lamhlat ngaingai ah cun kal hlah u, sihmanhsehlaw ralring cia tein nan um lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cun keimah le ka sinah a ummi vialte nih khua cu kan hun fuh lai. Cun kannih doh awkah an hung chuah tikah, hmasa bang khan kan zaamtak hna lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />cun khua in lamhlat ah kan hnuh dih hna hlantiang an kan dawi lai, zeicahtiah annih nih, “Hmasa bang khan kannih cu an kan zamtak,’ tiah an ti lai. Cuticun kan zaamtak hna lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />khi tikah nan lamhruang ahnak khan nan tho lai i khua cu nan tlaih lai; zeitintiah Bawipa nan Pathian nih nan kut chungah an pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun khua kha nan lak tikah Bawipa fialnak bangin nan tuah lai, khua cu mei in nan khangh lai; zohhmanh u, nawl kan pek hna hi,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuticun Joshua nih a thlah hna i lamhruang ahnak hmun ah khan an kal i Ai in nitlaklei Ai le Bethel karlak ah khan an um; sihmanhsehlaw cu zan cu Joshua cu mi zapi sinah khan a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu zingka tein a tho i mizapi kha a pumh hna i mi zapi hmaiah Israel mi upa hna he Ai ah cun an hung kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun amah sin i ralkap a ummi vialte cu an hung kal i khua cu a hmailei in an hei naih i Ai in chaklei ah an riak; anmah le Ai karlak ah horkuang pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun pa thong nga tluk a lak hna i Bethel le Ai karlak ah, khua in nitlaklei ah cun, lamhruang a ahter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuticun ralkap cu an chiah hna, riahhmunpi cu khua in chaklei ah, hnulei ralveng cu khua in nitlaklei ah. Sihmanhsehlaw Joshua kha cu zan cu nelrawn ah cun a riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Ai khua siangpahrang nih mah hihi a hmuh tikah amah le a mi vialte, khua chung i a ummi pa hna cu, khulrang in zingka tein Arabah lei i vung zuanchuknak ah khan Israel mi cu raldohnak hmun i ton awkah an kal; sihmanhsehlaw amah dohtu ah khua hnulei ah lamhruang attu an um ti kha a hngal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Joshua le Israel mi vialte nih khan an hmaiah cun a sung bantukin an i umter i ramlak leiah cun an zaam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cucaah khua chungah a ummi vialte cu anmah dawi awkah hmunkhat ah an kawh hna i Joshua cu an dawi i khua cun a hlatnak ah an lem hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ai ah siseh Bethel ah siseh, Israel dawi awkah a kal lomi ahohmanh an um lo; khua cu khar loin an kaltak i Israel mi cu an dawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khi tikah Bawipa nih Joshua sinah, “Na kut chungah a ummi fei kha Ai leiah sawh tuah; zeitintiah na kut chungah kan pek lai,” tiah a ti. Cun Joshua nih a kut chungah a ummi fei cu khua leiah cun a hei sawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lamhruang attu hna nih khan khulrang tein an umnak khan an tho i a kut a samh cangka an tli i khua chungah an lut i an lak; cun khua cu mei in khangh awkah an i hnawhnam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cucaah Ai khuami hna nih khan hnulei an hei zoh tikah, zohhmanh, khua meikhu cu van a tawng; cun annih cu hi lei khi lei ah an zaam kho lo, zeicahtiah ramlak leiah a tlimi hna nih khan a hun dawitu hna cu a rak an lehkhuh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Joshua le Israel mi vialte nih lamhruang attu hna nih khua an lak cang kha le khua meikhu cu a kai kha an hmuh tikah, khi tikah an i let i Ai khuami kha an thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun a dang hna nih khan khua lei khan an hun fuh hna; cucaah annih cu Israel mi nih an karceh hna, hi lei ah a cheu, khi lei ah a cheu; cun Israel mi nih an thah hna, pakhat hmanh a nungmi siseh a luatmi siseh an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Ai siangpahrang cu a nung in an lak i Joshua sinah an ratpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel mi nih an va dawi hna i pakhat hmanh an taan lo tiangin vainam in an va thahnak hna ramlak hmun ah khan Ai khuami cu an sam dih cikcek hna tikah, Israel mi vialte nih Ai khua ah khan an kir i vainam in an sam dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun cu ni ah, nu he pa he, Ai khuami vialte an dihlak in, a thimi cu sang khat le thong hnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zeitintiah Ai khuami vialte a hrawh dih cikcek hna hlantiang Joshua nih fei a sawhnak a kut kha a ṭhum ṭhan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joshua kha Bawipa nih nawl a pekmi bia bangin, khi khua saṭil hna le hranchaw hna tu cu Israel mi nih an hranchaw ah an i lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih Ai cu a khangh i nihin ni tiangah a si bangin, a rawkmi thil pon ah a ser.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Ai khua siangpahrang cu thingkung cungah zanlei tiang a thlai; cun ni a tlak zuahmah tikah Joshua nih nawl a pek hna i thingkung cung cun a pum cu an ṭhumh i khua hauka luhnak ah cun an hlonh i, a cungah lungpon nganpi an pumh; cucu nihin ni tiang hin a um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khi tikah Joshua nih Ebal Tlang ah Bawipa, Israel Pathian caah biakṭheng pakhat a ser,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa, sal Moses nih Israel mi nawl a pek hna bang khan, Moses phungbia cauk chung i, “remh lomi lung in sermi biakṭheng ahohmanh nih thir hreihriam in tawngh lomi,” tiin aa ṭial bang khan a ser. Cun cu cungah cun Bawipa, sinah khangh thawinak an pek i daihnak thawinak an thawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cun khika ah, Israel mi hna hmaika ah cun, Moses nih a ṭialmi phungbia kha lung hna cungah cun a ṭial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun Israel mi vialte cu, mipem he Israel mi chungchuak taktak he, an upa hna le an bawi hna le an biaceihtu hna he tiah, Bawipa biakamnak kuang a putu Levi mi tlangbawi hna hmai kuang hmailei le hnulei ah cun an dir, hnarcheu cu Gerizim Tlang hmaiah, hnarcheu cu Ebal Tlang hmaiah; Bawipa sal Moses nih a thawkterte ah Israel mi cu thluachuah nan pek hna lai, ti i nawl a rak pek hna bang khan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cun a hnuah phungbia chung bia vialte cu, thluachuahnak he chiatserhnak he, phungbia cauk chungah aa ṭialmi vialte ning khan, a rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Moses nawl pekmi chungin, Israel mi aa pummi vialte le nu le ngakchia le an sin i a ummi mipem hna hmaiah, Joshua nih a rel lomi bia pakhat hmanh a um lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan tiva ral tlangram le rawnram Rili Ngan kam ram thluahmah in Lebanon tlang tiang i a ummi Hit mi hna le Amor mi hna le Kanaan mi hna le Periz mi hna le Hiv mi hna le Jebus mi hna siangpahrang vialte hna nih mah hi kong cu an theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua le Israel cu doh awkah lung khat in an i pum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Gibeon khuami hna nih Joshua nih Jeriko le Ai cungah a tuahmi kha an theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />annih nih cun zer ngaiin an tuah; an kal i riahcaw an i rawnh i an laa hna kha sawngkhoi ṭet le a ṭet i a tlek i belhmi saphaw zucua kha an phorhter hna i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a ṭet i belhchommi kedan an i danh i hnipuan ṭet ṭiapṭuap an i aih; cun an riahcaw vialte cu a car i a buar dihmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Gilgal riahhmun ah khan Joshua le Israel mi hna sinah an va kal i, “Ram hla piin a rami kan si, cucaah kanmah he biakamnak ser u,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Israel mi hna nih cun Hiv mi hna sinah cun, “Kanmah lak i a ummi nan si sual men ko hnga; cu ti a si ahcun zeitindah nannih he biakamnak kan tuah khawh lai?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih nih Joshua sinah, “Na sal kan si ko hi ta,” tiah an ti. Cun Joshua nih annih cu, “Ahodah nan si, cun khuazei in dah nan rat?” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Annih nih, “ Bawipa na Pathian min ruangah ram hlat piin na sal hna hi kan ra; zeitindah Izipt ram ah a tuahmi vialte le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amor mi hna siangpahrang pahnih Jordan tiva ral i a ummi, Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon le Bashan siangpahrang Og, Ashtaroth ah a ummi hna cung i a tuahmi vialte kha kan theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun kan upa hna le kan ram minung vialte hna nih, ‘Lampi caah riahcaw i rawnh u law, va kal u law, va tong hna u, cun annih sinah, “Kannih cu nan sal kan si; ra u law, kanmah he biakamnak ser u,” tiah va ti hna u,’ tiah an kan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan riahcaw ca i kan changreu hna hi, nannih sin rat awk i kan inn in kan i thawh ni ah cun a lumte an si, sihmanhsehlaw atu cu, zohhmanh u, an car dih i an buar dih cang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />hi saphaw zucua hna hi kan rak rawn hna ah cun a tharte an rak si; sihmanhsehlaw, zohhmanh u, atu an kak dih cang; cun hi kan hnipuan hna le kan kedan hna hi kan ratnak lam a hlat tuk caah an ṭet dih cang,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah mi hna nih cun an hun phorhmi riahcaw cu an ei pi hna i Bawipa awka zeihmanh an ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih annih he remnak a ser i annih kha nunter dingah annih he biakamnak a ser; cun aa pummi hruaitu hna nih annih sinah chiat an ser.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Annih nih an sin i biakamnak an ser hnu ni thum ah an pawng ummi an si le an lak i an i cawh kha an theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Israel mi cu an i thawh i an khua cu a ni thumnak ni ah an va phanh hna. An khua hna cu Gibeon, Khefirah, Beeroth le Kiriath-jearim an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Israel mi nih cun an that hna lo, zeicahtiah aa pummi hruaitu nih khan Bawipa Israel Pathian chalh in an sinah chiat an ser cang. Khi tikah aa pummi vialte nih cu hruaitu hna cungah khan an phunzai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw hruaitu vialte hna nih khan aa pummi vialte sinah, “Kannih nih Bawipa Israel Pathian chalh in annih sinah chiat kan ser cang i cucaah kan tawngh hna ahcun a ṭha hnga lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mah hihi an cungah kan tuah lai i nung ko hna seh, kannih nih an sin i chiat kan rak ser cangmi biakamnak ruangah khan kan cungah thinhunnak a tlung sual ai hnga,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun hruaitu hna nih cun, “Nung ko hna seh,” tiah an ti hna. Cucaah hruaitu hna nih annih kongah an chim bang khan, annih cu aa pummi vialte caah, thinghlamtu le tithantu ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua nih a kawh hna i annih cu, “Zeicahdah kan sinah nan um ko nain, ‘Nan sinin lam hlatpi i a ummi kan si,’ tiin nan kan hlen?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cucaah nannih cu chiatserhmi nan si cang i, a cheu cu thing hlamtu le ti thantu sal, ka Pathian inn caah nan si zungzal lai,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Annih nih Joshua cu an leh i, “ Bawipa na Pathian nih a sal Moses kha hi ram hi a dihlak in nanmah kha pek awk le nan hmai in hi ram chung i a ummi vialte kha hrawh awkah nawl a pek ti kha fiang tein na sal hna kha an kan chimh i, cucaah nanmah ruangah hin kan nunnak kongah kan thin a phan ngaingai caah mah hi kan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Atu ah hin zohhmanh, na kut chungah kan um ko: na mithmuh ah a ṭha le a dik na ti bantukin kan cungah cun tuah ko,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cu bang cun an cungah a tuah i Israel mi hna kut chung khan a chuah hna i an that hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Joshua nih khi ni ah cun aa pummi ca le a thim laimi hmun i Bawipa biakṭheng caah annih cu nihin ni tiangin thing hlamtu le ti thantu ah a ser hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem siangpahrang Adonizedek nih zeitindah Joshua nih Ai kha a lak i Ai khua le a siangpahrang cu Jeriko le a siangpahrang a tuah hna bantukin a hrawh cikcek i, zeitindah Gibeon khuami hna nih Israel mi he remnak an ser i an lakah an um kha a theih tikah a thin a phang ngaingai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />zeicahtiah Gibeon cu siangpahrang khua bantukin khua ngan a si ve i Ai khua nakin a ngan deuh i a chung ummi vialte hna cu miṭhawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah Jerusalem siangpahrang Adonizedek nih Hebron siangpahrang Hoham le Jarmuth siangpahrang Piram le Lakhish siangpahrang Jafia le Eglon siangpahrang Debir cu a cah hna i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka sinah hung u law, ka bawm u, Gibeon cu tu u sih; Joshua le Israel mi hna he remnak a ser caah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khi tikah Amor mi siangpahrang panga, Jerusalem siangpahrang, Hebron siangpahrang, Jarmuth siangpahrang, Lakhish siangpahrang, le Eglon siangpahrang hna nih cun an ralkap kha an pumh hna i an ralkap dihlak he khan Gibeon khua cu a pawng in riahhnawh i hung hranh awkah an hung kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Gibeon mi hna nih cun Joshua cu Gilgal riahhmun ah cun an hei cah i, “Na sal hna cungin na kut kha dorh hlah; khulrang in hung law, kan khamh law, kan bawm tuah; zeitintiah tlang cungah khua a sami Amor mi siangpahrang vialte kha kanmah doh awkah an i pum,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua cu Gilgal in ralkap vialte le miralṭha miṭhawng vialte he tiah a hung kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i, “Ṭih hna hlah, zeitintiah annih cu na kut chungah kan pek cang hna; anmah lakah na hmaiah a dir khomi pakhat hmanh an um lai lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih zan khuadei te Gilgal in a hung kal i hlauhsaphak in a paoh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Israel mi hna hmaiah cun a comcawroi loin a zamter hna i, Gibeon ah cun tampi an thah hna, Beth-horon i hung kainak lam ah cun an dawi hna i Azekah le Makkedah khua tiang an thah lengmang hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Israel mi hmai i an zaam i Beth-horon i hung kainak in an va liam lioah khin Bawipa nih Azekah tiang vancung in lung ngan pipi a thlakhnawh hna i an thi; Israel mi nih nam in an thahmi hna nakin rial in a thimi cu an tam deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa nih Amor mi hna cu Israel mi hna sinah a pek hna ni ah Joshua nih Bawipa kha a chawnh i Israel mi hna mithmuh ah, “Ni, Gibeon ah dir peng tuah, Cun Thlapa, nang, Aijalon nelrawn ah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Miphun nih khan an ral hna cu phu an hlam hna hlantiang, Ni cu a dir peng i thlapa cu a taang. Mah hihi Jashar cauk ah aa ṭial lo mei? Ni cu van laifang ah khin a taang i ni khat pum tluk cu tlak tim loin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cu bantuk ni, Bawipa nih minung aw a ngaih ni bantuk kha, cu hlanah siseh cu hnuah siseh a um bal lo; zeitintiah Bawipa nih Israel cu a dohpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Joshua le Israel mi vialte cu an riahhmun Gilgal ah cun an kir dih ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi siangpahrang panga hna cu an zaam i Makkedah i lungkua ah an i thup
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu, “Siangpahrang panga hna kha an hmuh cang hna, Makkedah i lungkua ah an i thup ko,’ tiah an chimh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih, “Lungkua kaa ah cun lung ngan pipi hril hna u, cun a pawngah anmah cawngtu ah mi chia hna u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw cuka ah cun nannih cu um hlah u, nan ral kha dawi hna u, an hnu dawn pawl kha tlak phuat hna u, an khua chungah khan luhter hrimhrim hna hlah u; zeitintiah Bawipa nan Pathian nih annih cu nan kut chungah an pek cang hna,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joshua le Israel mi hna nih an ci a mih hlantiang an thah cikcek hna tik le a tangmi tete hna cu kulhmi khua chungah an luh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mi vialte cu him tein Joshua sinah Makkedah riahhmun ah cun an kir; Israel mi ahohmanh kha, pakhat hmanh nih bia an chim ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih, “Lungkua kaa kha hung u law, lungkua chung khan siangpahrang panga hna kha ka sinah rak chuahpi tuah hna u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cu bangin an tuah i lungkua chung khan siangpahrang panga hna kha a sinah an chuahpi hna, Jerusalem siangpahrang, Hebron siangpahrang, Jarmuth siangpahrang, Lakhish siangpahrang le Eglon siangpahrang hna cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun cu siangpahrang hna cu Joshua sinah an chuahpi hna tikah, Joshua nih Israel mi vialte kha a kawh hna i amah sinah a kalmi ralkap hna bawi hna sinah khan, “Rak ka naih tuah u, hi siangpahrang hna hngawng hi lam tuah hna u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih annih sinah, “Nan thin phang hlah u, nan lung zong dong hlah u; ṭhawng u law, ralṭha ngaiin um tuah u; zeicahtiah Bawipa nih nan dohmi hna nan ral vialte cungah kha bang khan a tuah lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun a hnuah Joshua nih a tuk hna i a thah hna i thingkung panga cungah a thlai hna. Cun thingkung cungah cun zanlei tiang an i thlai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw ni a tlak cuahmah tikah, Joshua nih nawl a pek hna i thingkung cung khan an ṭhumh hna i, an i thuhnak lungkua chungah khan an hlonh hna i lungkua kaa cu lung ngan pipi in an khar, nihin ni tiang hrimhrim hin a um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun khi ni ah Joshua nih Makkedah cu a lak i cu khua le a siangpahrang cu vainam in a sam dih hna; a chung i a ummi paohpaoh cu a thah dih hna, pakhat hmanh a zuah hna lo; cun Jeriko siangpahrang cungah a tuah bang khan Makkedah siangpahrang cungah cun a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu a sinah a ummi Israel mi vialte he Makkedah in Libnah ah an va lan i Libnah kha an doh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />cun Bawipa nih cu khua cu an siangpahrang he tiah Israel mi kut chungah a pek hna; cu khua cu a chung i a ummi vialte he vainam in a sam dih hna; pakhat hmanh a zuah hna lo; Jeriko siangpahrang cungah a tuah bang khan an siangpahrang cungah cun a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu a sinah a ummi Israel mi vialte hna he Libnah in Lakhish ah an va lan i an kulh i an tuk:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />cun Bawipa nih Lakhish khua cu Israel mi kut chungah a pek i a ni hnihnak ni ah a lak i cu khua cu a chung i a ummi vialte he vainam in a sam, Libnah cung i a tuah bantuk khan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun Gezer siangpahrang Horam cu Lakhish bawmh awkah a hung kal i, Joshua nih amah he a mi hna he, pakhat hmanh taang lo tiangin, a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu Israel mi vialte he Lakhish in Eglon ah an va lan; cun an kulh i an doh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />cu ni ah cun an lak i vainam in an sam dih; cu khua chung i a ummi paoh cu khi ni ah a hrawh cikcek hna, Lakhish cung i a tuah bang khan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu Israel mi vialte he Eglon in Hebron ah an hung kal i an hung doh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />an lak i a siangpahrang he a khua hna he, a chung i a ummi vialte hna he, vainam in an sam dih hna; pakhat hmanh a zuah hna lo, Eglon cungah a tuah bantuk khan, a chung i a ummi vialte he a hrawh dih cikcek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu Israel mi vialte he Debir leiah aa mer i a doh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />a siangpahrang he a khua hna he a lak dih; vainam in an sam dih hna i a chung i a ummi vialte cu an hrawh cikcek hna; pakhat hmanh a zuah hna lo; Hebron cung le Libnah le a siangpahrang cung i a tuah bang khan Debir le a siangpahrang cungah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cu bangin Joshua nih ram cu a ning piin, tlangram siseh, Negeb siseh, rawnram siseh, tlangpangzau siseh, an siangpahrang vialte he a tei dih hna; pakhat hmanh a zuah hna lo, Bawipa Israel Pathian nih nawl a pek bang khan thaw a chuah paohpaoh cu a hrawh dih cikcek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Joshua nih annih cu Kadesh-barnea in Gaza tiang a tei hna. Goshen ram vialte zong Gibeon tiangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Bawipa Israel Pathian nih Israel mi cu a dohpi hna caah Joshua nih hi siangpahrang vialte hna le an ram cu ṭum khat ah a lak dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cun Joshua cu amah sinah a ummi Israel mi vialte he Gilgal i an riahhmun ah cun an kir ṭhan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun hi kong cu Hazor siangpahrang Jabin nih a theih tikah, Madon siangpahrang Jobab le Shimron siangpahrang le Akhshaf siangpahrang le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chaklei tlangram i a ummi siangpahrang hna le Khinneroth thlang Arabah i a ummi siangpahrang hna le rawnram i a ummi siangpahrang hna le nitlaklei Nafoth-dor i a ummi siangpahrang hna le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nichuahlei le nitlaklei i a ummi Kanaan mi hna le, tlangram i a ummi Amor mi hna, Hit mi hna, Periz mi hna le Jebus mi hna le Hermon tang Mizpah ram i a ummi Hiv mi hna cu bia a cah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun an ralkap vialte hna le an rang le an rangleng tampi hna he tiah an ra chuak ciammam i, bu nganpi, an tam ning cu rili kam i thetse zat hrimhrim an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun hi siangpahrang vialte hna nih cun an ralkapbu vialte cu an fonh hna i Israel mi kha doh awkah Merom ti ah cun an ra i an riak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i, “Annih kha ṭih hna hlah, zeicahtiah thaizing atu tikah hin an dihlak in thah cia in Israel mi sinah ka pek hna lai; an rang cu an tha nan pheh hna lai i an rangleng cu mei in nan khangh hna lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua le a ralkap vialte hna nih cun Merom ti pawngah cun duak tiah an va pauh hna i an nam colh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih annih cu Israel mi kut chungah a pek hna i an thah hna i, Sidon Ngan le Misrefoth-maim tiang, cun nichuahlei ah Mizpah nelrawn tiang an dawi hna; pakhat hmanh an taan ti lo tiang an thah lengmang hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih a fial bantukin Joshua nih an cungah a tuah; an rang kha an tha an pheh hna i an rangleng kha mei in a khangh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun khi caan ah Joshua cu a let i Hazor kha a lak, an siangpahrang cu vainam in a thah; zeitintiah Hazor cu hmasa ah cun cu peng vialte hna lu cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A chungah a ummi vialte cu vainam in an thah dih hna i an hrawh cikcek hna; thaw a chuahmi pakhat hmanh an zuah lo; Hazor cu mei in a khangh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun cu siangpahrang hna khua vialte le an siangpahrang hna cu Joshua nih a lak hna i vainam in a thah hna, a hrawh cikcek hna, Bawipa sal Moses nih nawl a rak pek bang khan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mual cung i a ummi khua hna tu cu, Joshua nih a khanghmi Hazor dah ti lo cu, Israel mi nih an khang hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun hi khua hranchaw vialte hna le saṭil hna cu Israel mi nih hranchaw ah an i lak dih; sihmanhsehlaw mi cu an hrawh dih hna hlantiang nam in an thah hna i thaw a chuahmi pakhat hmanh an ngan ta hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa nih a sal Moses kha nawl a pek bangin Moses nih Joshua kha nawl a pek chin i cu bang cun Joshua nih a tuah; Bawipa nih Moses nawl a pekmi vialte kha pakhat hmanh a hrelhmi an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih cu ram vialte, tlangram le Negeb vialte le Goshen ram vialte le rawnram le Arabah le Israel tlangram le a rawnram cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Seir lei i a hung kaimi Halak Tlang in Hermon Tlang tang i a ummi Lebanon nelrawn i a ummi Baal-gad tiangin a lak dih hna. Cun an siangpahrang vialte kha a lak hna i a tuk hna i a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joshua nih cu siangpahrang hna he cun saupi an i do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gibeon i a ummi Hiv mi hna dah ti lo cu Israel mi hna he remnak a tuahmi khua pakhat hmanh an um lo, an dihlak in raldohnak i an lakmi an si dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa nih Moses nawl a pek bangin hrawh cikcek an si i zaangfahnak um loin hloh cikcek an si nakhnga, an lung ṭhawnter i Israel mi hna doh cu Bawipa tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun khi caan ah Joshua cu a ra i tlangram a simi Hebron, Debir, Anab le Judah tlangram vialte in le Israel tlangram vialte in Anak mi cu a hloh dih hna; Joshua nih an khua hna he a hrawh cikcek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mi ram chungah Anak mi cu pakhat hmanh an tang lo; Gaza le Gath le Ashdod lawngah tlawmpal an tang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa nih Moses sinah a rak chim cangmi vialte bantuk khan Joshua nih ram cu a ning piin a lak i an phun ning cio i phawtning khan Joshua nih Israel mi hna sinah ro caah a pek hna. Cun ram cu ral in aa din.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mah hna hi Israel mi nih an tei i an ram an chuhmi hna, Jordan tiva ral nichuahlei ram, Arnon nelrawn in Hermon Tlang tiang, Arabah in nichuahlei paohpaoh ram siangpahrang hna cu an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Heshbon khua ah a ummi Amor mi siangpahrang Sihon. A uknak cu Arnon tiva nelrawn kam i a ummi Aroer khua in le cu nelrawn laifang in Ammon mi ramri Jabbok tiva tiang a si, cucu Gilead ram hnarcheu a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cun Arabah zong, Khinneroth Rili tiang nichuahlei kam zuahmah in, cun Beth-jeshimoth leiah Arabah rili tiang, cucu Cite Rili a si, cun thlanglei ah Pisgah tlangpangzau hram tiangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun, Refaim mi lakin a taangmi pakhat Bashan siangpahrang Og zong. Amah cu Ashtaroth le Edrei khua ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah nih Hermon Tlang le Salekah le Bashan vialte, Geshur mi hna le Maakath mi hna ramri tiang, cun Gilead ram hnarcheu Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon ramri tiangin a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa sal Moses le Israel mi hna nih an tei hna; Bawipa sal Moses nih cun an ram cu Reuben mi le Gad mi le Manasseh phun cheu hna sinah khan ro caah a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jordan tiva nitlaklei ah, Lebanon nelrawn i a ummi Baal-gad in Seir leiah a hung kaimi Halak Tlang tiang i, Joshua le Israel mi nih an teimi, cu ram siangpahrang hna cu mah hna hi an si cun Joshua nih an ram cu Israel miphun hna sinah khan an i ṭhenhning in ro caah a pek hna, —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tlangram ah siseh, rawnram ah siseh, Arabah ah siseh, tlangpang zau ah siseh, ramlak ah siseh, Negeb ah siseh, cucu Hit mi le Amor mi le Kanaan mi le Periz mi le Hiv mi le Jebus mi hna ram an si):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jeriko siangpahrang, pakhat; Bethel pawngah a ummi Ai siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem siangpahrang, pakhat; Hebron siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jarmuth siangpahrang, pakhat; Lakhish siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eglon siangpahrang, pakhat; Gezer siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Debir siangpahrang, pakhat; Geder siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hormah siangpahrang, pakhat; Arad siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Libnah siangpahrang, pakhat; Adullam siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Makkedah siangpahrang, pakhat; Bethel siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tappuah siangpahrang, pakhat; Hefer siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Afek siangpahrang, pakhat; Lasharon siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Madon siangpahrang, pakhat; Hazor siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shimron-meron siangpahrang, pakhat; Akhshaf siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Taan-akh siangpahrang, pakhat; Megiddo siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kedesh siangpahrang, pakhat; Karmel ah a ummi Jokneam siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nafath-dor ah a ummi Dor siangpahrang, pakhat; Galilee ah a ummi Goi-im siangpahrang, pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tirzah siangpahrang, pakhat; an dihlak in siangpahrang sawm thum le pakhat an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atu cu Joshua cu a upa i a tar ngaingai cang. Bawipa nih a chawnh i, “Nang cu na upa i na tar ngaingai cang, asinain co awk ram tampi a um rih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mah hihi a tang rihmi ram cu a si; Filistin mi hna ram a dihlak le Geshur mi ram a dihlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Izipt nichuahlei i a ummi Shihor in chaklei ah Ekron ramri tiang, mah cucu Kanaan mi ram ah rel a si; cun Filistin bawi panga an um, Gaza i le Ashdod i le Ashkelon i le Gath i le Ekron i hna cu an si),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />cun thlanglei ah Avvim mi hna ram zong, Kanaan mi hna ram vialte le Sidon mi ta a simi Mearah, Amor mi hna ramri Afek tiang le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gebal mi hna ram le nichuahlei ah Lebanon vialte, Hermon Tlang tang i a ummi Baal-gad in Hamath khua luhnak tiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tlang ram i a ummi vialte Lebanon in Misrefoth-maim tiang, Sidon mi vialte hna cu. Keimah hrimhrim nih Israel mi hna hmai in ka dawi hna lai; nawl kan pek bantuk khan ram cu Israel mi hna sinah ro caah a cheuh tu cu rak cheu ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cucaah atu cu hi ram hi phun kua le Manasseh phun cheu hna kha ro caah cheu tuah hna,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dang Manasseh phun cheu hna he cun, Reuben mi le Gad mi nih Moses nih a pek hna bang khan an ro kha an co, Jordan ral nichuahlei ah khan, Bawipa sal Moses nih a pek hna bang khan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Arnon tiva nelrawn ri ah a ummi Aroer khua thawk in, cu nelrawn laifang ah a ummi khua le Medeba tlangrawn ram vialte Dibon tiangin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />cun Heshbon ah a ummi Amor mi siangpahrang Sihon khua vialte, Ammon mi hna ramri tiang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />cun Gilead ram le Geshur mi hna le Maakath mi hna ram le, Hermon tlang vialte le, Bashan dihlak Salekah tiangin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ashtaroth le Edrei in a pengtu Bashan siangpahrang Og pennak vialte (Refaim mi hna lakin a taangmi hna lakah amah lawng cu a tang); mah hna hi Moses nih a tei hna i a dawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Geshur mi si hna seh, Maakath mi si hna seh, Israel mi nih an dawi hna lo; Geshur le Maakath cu nihin ni tiang hin Israel mi lakah an um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi phun lawng kha Moses nih ro a pek lomi cu a si; Bawipa Israel Pathian sinah mei in pekchanhmi thil cu, a chimh cang bang khan annih ro cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Moses nih Reuben miphun cu an innchungkhar ning cio ah ro a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cucaah an ram cu Arnon nelrawn ri ah a ummi Aroer khua in le, nelrawn laifang ah a ummi khuapi le, Medeba hrawng tlangrawn ram vialte cu a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heshbon le tlangrawn ram chungah a ummi khua vialte he; Dibon le Bamoth-baal le Beth-baal-meon le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jahaz le Kedemoth le Mefaath le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kiriathaim le Sibmah le nelrawn tlang cungah a ummi Zereth-shahar le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beth-peor le Pisgah tlangpang zau le Beth-jeshimoth zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />cucu tlangrawn ram khua vialte le Heshbon i bawi a simi Amor siangpahrang Sihon pennak vialte cu a si. Moses nih amah cu Midian mi hruaitu hna Evi le Rekem le Zur le Hur le Reba, Sihon bawi ram chungah a ummi hna he cun a tei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beor fapa Balaam, camthiammi zong kha Israel mi nih an thahmi hna lakah khan vainam in an thah chih ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Reuben mi hna ramri cu Jordan tiva cu a si. Mah hihi Reuben mi hna nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah an comi ram cu a si, an khuapi hna le an khuate hna he tiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun Moses nih Gad miphun zong an innchungkhar ning cio ah ro a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An ram cu mah hna hi a si: Jazer le, Gilead ram khua vialte le, Ammon mi hna ram hnarcheu, Rabbah nichuahlei ah a ummi Aroer tiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />cun Heshbon in Ramath-mizpeh le Betonim tiang, cun Mahanaim in Debir ram tiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />cun nelrawn chungah Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon pennak a taangmi, Beth-haram, Beth-nimrah, Sukkoth le Zafon; a ramri cu Jordan tiva Khinneroth Rili a thlanglei kam tiang a si; cu ram cu Jordan tiva ral nichuahlei ram cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mah hihi Gad mi hna nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah, an comi ram cu a si, khuapi hna le a khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Moses nih Manasseh phuncheu cu ro a pek; an innchungkhar ning cio in Manasseh phuncheu cu pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An ram cu Mahanaim in Bashan ram vialte a dihlak, Bashan siangpahrang Og pennak vialte cu a ning piin, Bashan chung i a ummi Jair khua vialte, khua sawm ruk hna cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />cun Gilead ram a cheu le Bashan ram chung i Og nih a penmi ram khuapi Ashtaroth le Edrei. Mah hna hi Manasseh fapa Makhir tefa hna cu pek an si, an innchungkhar ning cio ah Makhir mi hnarcheu cu pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jordan tiva ral Jeriko in nichuahlei Moab nelrawn chung i Moses nih a phawtmi hna ram cu mah hna hi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Levi phun cu Moses nih ro a pe hna lo; an sinah a rak chim bang khan Bawipa Israel Pathian cu an ro cu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun mah hna hi Kanaan ram chungah Israel mi nih an comi ram cu an si, tlangbawi Eleazar le Num fapa Joshua le Israel tefa hna chung i an phun cio lu hna nih an phawtmi hna cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa nih Moses nawl a pek bang khan phun kua le a cheu caah cun an co ning cu camcawh fung zuh in a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />zeitintiah Moses nih Jordan tiva ral ah phun hnih le a cheu cu ro kha a pek cang hna; sihmanhsehlaw annih lakah Levi mi hna cu ro a pe hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josef tefa hna cu phun hnih an si, Manasseh le Efraim; ram chungah Levi mi hna cu vo an pe hna lo, sihmanhsehlaw umnak khua hna le cu pawngkam i caw le saṭil dang tlonnak ram lawnglawng cu pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nih Moses nawl a pek bang khan Israel mi nih an tuah; ram cu an i ṭhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Judah phunmi kha Joshua sinah Gilgal ah an ra i Keniz phun Jefunneh fapa Kaleb nih a sinah, “Nangmah le keimah kongah, Bawipa nih Pathian mi Moses sinah Kadesh-barnea ah bia a chimmi kha na hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa sal Moses nih ram cu hung ngiatthlai awkah Kadesh-barnea in a ka thlah tikah kum sawm li ka rak si; cun ka lungchung i a umning bantuk tein bia cu amah cu ka rak phorh ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw keimah he a hung kal ṭimi ka unau hna nih khan mizapi cu an awlok an chonter hna, sihmanhsehlaw kei tu nih cun Bawipa ka Pathian kha fek tein ka zulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Moses nih khi ni ah chiat a ser i, ‘ Bawipa ka Pathian cu fek tein na zulh caah, na ke nih a lamhmi ram cu nangmah ca le na tefa hna caah zungzal in ro an si hrimhrim lai,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun atu cu, zohhmanh, Bawipa nih a chim bang khan hi kum sawm li le kum nga chung hi Bawipa nih Moses sinah hi bia a chim ri khan a ka nunter, Israel mi nih ramlak ah an vah lioah khan; cun atu cu zohhmanh, nihin ni ah hin kum sawm riat le kum nga ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses nih a rak ka thlah ni i ka ṭhawn tluk te khan nihin ni tiang ka ṭhawng ko rih; raldohnak caah siseh, kalnak caah siseh, ratnak caah siseh, atu i ka thazang cu kha lio i ka thazang bantuk kha a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa nih kha ni ah a rak chimmi tlangram cu atu ah hin ka pe tuah, zeitintiah Anak mi hna nih zeitindah khika ah kulhmi khualipi hna he an um kha, kha ni ah khan na rak theih cang. Bawipa nih a chim bang khan Bawipa nih a hei ka umpi hnga i ka hei ṭhawl khawh ko hna hnga dah kaw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih thluachuah a pek i Hebron cu Jefunneh fapa Kaleb sinah khan ro caah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah Hebron cu Keniz phun Jefunneh fapa Kaleb ro ah, Bawipa, Israel Pathian kha fek tein a rak zulh caah, nihin ni tiang hin a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hebron khua min cu a hlanah cun Kiriath-arba a rak si; hi Arba cu Anak mi hna lakah mingan bik a rak si. Cun ram cu raldohnak in aa din.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah phun caah an innchungkhar ning cio ah an vo cu thlanglei ah Edom ramri, thlanglei bik ah Zin ramlak tiang a phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun an thlanglei ramri cu Cite Rili kam, thlanglei a zohmi rili fonghlei thawk in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akrabbim i hung kainak thlanglei in a kal i Zin a hei phan, cun Kadesh-barnea thlanglei ah a hung kai, cun Hezron pawng in Addar tiang a kal, cun Karka lei ah aa mer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azmon tiang a lan i Izipt Tivate ah a hung chuak; cuticun an ramri cu rili ah a dong. Mah hihi an thlanglei ramri cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun nichuahlei an ramri cu Cite Rili a si, Jordan tiva chuak tiang. Cun chaklei kam ramri cu Jordan tiva chuak i rili fonghlei in aa thawk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />cun ramri cu Beth-hoglah ah a hung kai i Beth-arabah chak in a lan; cun ramri cu Reuben fapa Bohan Lung tiang a hung kai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />cun ramri cu Akhor nelrawn in Debir tiang a hung kai; cuticun chaklei ah a kal, cun nelrawn thlanglei kamah a ummi Adummim i hung kainak ralchan i a ummi Gilgal leiah aa mer; cun ramri cu En-shemesh ti tiang a lan i En-rogel ah a dong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cun ramri cu Jebus mi umnak tlang thlanglei fing (cucu Jerusalem) i Hinnom fapa nelrawn leiah a hung kai; cun ramri cu, nitlaklei ah, Refaim nelrawn chaklei kamah, Hinnom horkuang ralchan i a ummi tlangpar tiang a hung kai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />cun ramri cu tlangpar cun Neftoah Ti a putnak tiang a vung kal i cuka cun Efron Tlang khua hna tiang a lan; cun ramri cu Baalah (cucu Kiriath-jearim) leiah aa kuai i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ramri cu Baalah nitlaklei ah Seir Tlang leiah aa let, Jearim Tlang (cucu Khesalon) chaklei fing kha a zulh i Beth-shemesh tiang a vung kal i Timnah pawng in a lan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ramri cu Ekron fing tiang chaklei ah a kal, cun Shikkeron leiah aa kuai i Baalah Tlang leiah a kal i Jabneel ah a chuak; cun ramri cu rili ah a dong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun nitlaklei ramri cu Rili Ngan le a kam cu a si. Mah hihi Judah phun, an innchungkhar ning cio in, an velchum i an ramri cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa nih Joshua nawl a pekmi bangin, Jefunneh fapa Kaleb cu Judah mi hna lakah vo pakhat, Kiriath-arba cu a pek, cucu Hebron a si (Arba cu Anak pa kha a si).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Kaleb nih khika in Anak fapa pathum, Sheshai, Ahimah, le Talmai, Anak tefa hna cu, a dawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun khika in Debir khuami kha doh awkah a hung kal; hlanah cun Debir min cu Kiriath-sefer a rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Kaleb nih, “Kiriath-sefer atu i a latu paoh cu ka fanu Aksah kha nupi ah ka pek lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Kaleb nau Kenaz fapa Othniel nih a lak i, amah cu a fanu Aksah cu nupi ah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aksah nih a sinah a rat tikah, a pa kha lo pakhat hal awkah a fial; cun a laa cungin a ṭum i Kaleb nih, “Zei dah na duh?” tiah Aksah cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah nih, “Laksawng pakhat in ka pe tuah; Negeb ram chungah na ka chiah caah, tiput hna zong kha ka pek chih tuah,” a ti. Cun Kaleb nih chaklei tiput hna le thlanglei tiput hna kha a pek chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah phun nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah an comi ram cu mah hi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom ramri leiah thlanglei bik ah Judah phun i an khua hna cu mah hihi an si: Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kinah, Dimonah, Adadah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kedesh, Hazor, Ithnan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zif, Telem, Bealoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hazor-hadattah, Kerioth-hezron (cucu Hazor),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amam, Shema, Moladah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-gaddah, Heshmon, Beth-pelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hazar-shual, Beersheba, Biziothia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Baalah, I-im, Ezem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eltolad, Khesil, Hormah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziklag, Madmannah, Sansannah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lebaoth, Shilhim, Ain, le Rimmon; a zapi ah khuapi pakul le pakua an si, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun rawnram ah, Eshtaol, Zorah, Ashnah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanoah, En-gannim, Tappuah, Enam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jarmuth, Adullam, Sokoh, Azekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Shaaraim, Adithaim, Gederah, Gederothaim; khuapi hleili, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zenan, Hadashah, Migdal-gad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dilean, Mizpah, Jokthe-el,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lakhish, Bozkath, Eglon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kabbon, Lahmam, Khitlish,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Gederoth, Beth-dagon, Naamah, le Makkedah; khuapi hleiruk, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Libnah, Ether, Ashan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Iftah, Ashnah, Nezib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keilah, Akhzib, le Mareshah; khuapi pakua, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ekron, a khuapi hna le a khuate hna he;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ekron in rili tiang, Ashdod sir i a ummi vialte, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ashdod, a khuapi hna le a khuate hna; Gaza, a khuapi hna le a khuate hna; Izipt tiva le rili ngan le a kam tiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cun tlangram ah, Shamir, Jattir, Sokoh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Dannah, Kiriath-sannah (cucu Debir),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Anab, Eshtemoth, Anim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Goshen, Holon, le Giloh; khuapi hleikhat, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Arab, Dumah, Eshan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Janim, Beth-tappuah, Afekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Humtah, Kiriath-arba (cucu Hebron), le Zior; khuapi pakua, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Maon, Karmel, Zif, Juttah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kain, Gibeah, le Timnah; khuapi pahra, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Halhul, Beth-zur, Gedor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ma-arath, Beth-anoth, le Eltekon; khuapi paruk, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Kiriath-baal (cucu Kiriath-jearim), le Rabbah; khuapi pahnih, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Ramlak ah, Beth-arabah, Middin, Sekakah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Nibshan, Cite Khua, le En-gedi; khuapi paruk, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Jerusalem khuami Jebus mi hna cu Judah mi hna nih an dawi kho hna lo; cucaah nihin ni tiangin Jebus mi hna cu Judah mi hna he Jerusalem ah an um ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josef tefa hna vo cu Jeriko pawng Jordan tiva Jeriko tiput hna nichuahlei kap in aa thawk i ramlak ah a lut i Jeriko in Bethel tlangram ah a hung kai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />cun Bethel in Luz ah a kal i Arki mi ram Ataroth ah a lan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cun nitlaklei ah Jaflet mi hna ram ah a vung kal, thlanglei Beth-horon ram tiang; cun Gezer ah a phan i rili ah a dong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josef mi Manasseh le Efraim nih an vo ding kha an co.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An innchungkhar ning cio ah, Efraim mi hna ram cu a tanglei bangin a si: nichuahlei kamah an vo ramri cu Ataroth-addar, chaklei Beth-horon tiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />cun ramri cu khika in rili ah a vung kal; chaklei ah ramri cu Mikmethath a si; cun nichuahlei ah ramri cu Taanath-shiloh lei ah aa kuai i a hei lonh i nichuahlei ah Janoah ah a kal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />cun Janoah in Ataroth le Naarah tiang a vung kal, Jeriko kha a hei pal pah i Jordan ah a dong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tappuah in ramri cu nitlaklei ah a kal i Kanah tivate a phan i rili ah a dong. Cu bantukin Efraim mi hna nih an innchungkhar ning cio in an comi ram cu a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasseh ram chung i Efraim mi hna caah an chiahmi khua hna, cu khua vialte hna le an khuate hna he cun tiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Gezer i a ummi Kanaan mi kha cu an dawi hna lo; cu caah nihin tiangin Kanaan mi hna cu Efraim mi hna lakah an um, sihmanhsehlaw hnekmi rian ṭuan awkah sal ah an cang cang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Manasseh phun kha vo pek an si, amah cu Josef fater kha a si. Manasseh fater Makhir, Gilead pa cu ralkap a si caah Gilead le Bashan kha pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Manasseh phun chung i a taang rihmi hna cu an innchungkhar ning cio ah vo phawt an si, Abiezer, Helek, Asriel, Shekhem, Hefer le Shemida; mah hna hi Josef fapa Manasseh i a tefa hna cu pa lei in an innchungkhar ning cio ah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Manasseh fapa Makhir fapa Gilead fapa Hefer i fapa Zelofehad cu fapa a ngei lo, fanu lawnglawng a ngeih hna; mah hna hi a fanule hna min cu an si: Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milkah, le Tirzah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlangbawi Eleazar le Nun fapa Joshua le haotu hna sinah cun an ra i, “ Bawipa nih Moses cu, kan unau hna sinah covo kan ngeih ve nakhnga, nawl a pek,” tiah an ti. Cucaah Bawipa nawlbia bang cun an pa unau hna lakah cun covo a pek ve hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuticun Manasseh nih vo hra a co, Jordan khattelei ral i a ummi Gilead le Bashan ram hleiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />zeicahtiah Manasseh fanu hna nih a fapa hna he vo an co ve caah a si. Gilead ram cu Manasseh mi a dang hna nih cun an co.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manasseh ram cu Asher in Shekhem nichuahlei i a ummi Mikmethath tiang a phan; cun ramri cu thlanglei ah En-Tappuah mi umnak tiangin a vung kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tappuah ram cu Manasseh ta a si, sihmanhsehlaw Manasseh ramri i a ummi Tappuah khua cu Efraim fapale hna ta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun ramri cu Kanah tivate ah a vung kal. Hi tivate thlanglei i a ummi, Manasseh khua hna lak i a ummi khua hna hi cu Efraim ta an si. Cun Manasseh ramri cu cu tiva chaklei kam cun a kal i rili ah a dong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thlanglei kam cu Efraim ram a si i chaklei kam cu Manasseh ram a si, ramri ah cun rili a si; chaklei ah Asher a phan, nichuahlei ah Issakhar a phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Issakhar le Ahser chung zongah cun Beth-shean le a khuate hna, Ibleam le a khuate hna, Dor le a khuate hna, i a ummi hna Endor le a khuate hna i a ummi hna Taanak le a khuate hna i a ummi hna, Megiddo le a khuate hna i a ummi hna cu Manasseh ta an si; a pathumnak cu Nafath a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Manasseh fapa hna nih cu khuami hna cu an pawnchuah kho hna lo; Kanaan mi hna cu cu ram ah cun an i benh peng ve ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Israel mi kha an hung ṭhawn tikah Kanaan mi hna cu hnekmi rian kha an ṭuanter hna i an dawi dih cikcek hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Josef phun nih Joshua kha an chawnh i, “Kei cu atu tiangah Bawipa nih thluachuahnak a ka pek caah mi tampi ka si nain, zeicahdah covo pakhat le hmun pakhat lawnglawng na ka pek?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih annih cu, “Nannih cu mi tampi nan si ahcun, tupi ah khin hung kal u law, Periz mi le Refaim mi hna ram ah lo hung vat ngat u, Efraim tlangram cu nan caah a bit tuk ṭung cu ta,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef phun nih cun, “Tlangram cu kan caah cun aa za lo; sihmanhsehlaw rawn i a ummi Kanaan mi vialte hna cu Beth-shean le a khuate i a ummi nih si hna seh, Jezreel Nelrawn i a ummi nih si hna seh thir rangleng an ngei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih Josef tefa Efraim le Manasseh sinah cun, “Nannih cu mi tampi nan si i nan ṭhawng ngaingai; vo pakhat lawng nan co lai lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw tlangram cu nan ta a si lai, tupi a si nain nan vah lai i a deng tiangin nan co lai; Kanaan mi hna cu thir rangleng an ngei i an ṭhawng nain nan ṭhawl hna lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Israel mibu cu an ning piin Shiloh ah an i pum i khika ah tonnak thlam kha an bunh; an hmaiah ram cu tei in a um ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi hna lakah phun sarih, vo cheuh rih lomi an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih Israel mi hna sinah cun, “ Bawipa, nan pupa Pathian nih an pekmi hna ram chungah hin luh i va co awkah zei can dah nan i daithlanh lai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phun khat nih mi pathum cio i thawh u law, ka thlah hna lai; an i thawh lai i ram cu a dihlak in an ṭol lai i, an covo hnga ding kha ruahchih in ram kong cu an ṭial lai i keimah sinah an ra lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vo pasarih ah an cheu lai, Judah pawl cu an ram chungah thlanglei ah khan an um ko lai i Josef chungle hna cu an ram chungah chaklei ah khan an um ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmun sarih in cheumi ram kong cu nan ṭial lai i nan ṭialmi cu hika ka sinah nan rak put lai; cun Bawipa kan Pathian hmaiah hika ah nan caah camcawh fung kan khiahpiak hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi mi hna cu nannih lakah vo an ngei lo, zeitintiah Bawipa tlangbawi an sinak cu an ro a si; cun Gad le Reuben le Manasseh phun cheu nih khan Bawipa sal Moses nih a pekmi hna an vo cu Jordan nichuahlei ral ah khan an co cang,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cucaah mi hna cu an i thawh. Ram kong ṭial awkah a kalmi hna cu Joshua nih bia a beuh hna i, “Ram cu va ṭol dih u law, a kong kha va ṭial u law, ka sinah ra ṭhan u; cun nannih caah Bawipa hmaiah hika ah hin Shiloh ah camcawh fung kan khiahpiak hna lai,” tiah a ti,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cucaah, mi cu an kal i ram cu an ṭol dih; hmun sarih ah an cheumi ram kong cu cauk chungah a khua a khua in an ṭial; cun Joshua sinah Shiloh i an riahhmun ah khan an ra i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Shiloh ah cun Bawipa hmaiah Joshua nih camcawh fung a khiahpiak hna. Khika ah Joshua nih Israel mi hna cu ram kha a cheuh hna, an vo cio kha, a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benjamin phun innchungkhar ca i camcawh fung cu a hung chuak i an comi ram cu Judah phun le Josef phun karlak ah khan a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chaklei kamah an ramri cu Jordan ah aa thawk; cun ramri cu Jeriko chak ah a ummi fing ah a hung kai, cun nitlaklei ah tlangram kha a tan i Beth-aven ramlak ah a dong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khika in ramri cu Luz lei ah thlanglei ah a vung kal i Luz fing (cucu Bethel) kha a phan. Cun ramri cu Thlanglei Beth-horon thlang i a ummi tlang cung i Ataroth-addar khua ah cun a vung phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun ramri cu kaa dang leiah aa mer i nitlaklei ramri ah a cang. Beth-horon thlang i a ummi mual in thlanglei ah a kal i Kiriath-baal ah a dong (cucu Kiriath-jearim a si), cu khua cu Judah phun ta a si. Mah hihi nitlaklei ramri cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun thlanglei kam cu Kiriath-jearim donghnak ah a thawk i ramri cu khika in Efron ah a kal, cun Neftoah Ti a putnak tiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />cun ramri cu Refaim nelrawn chaklei donghnak ah a ummi Hinnom fapa nelrawn ralchan i a ummi tlang hram ah a vung kal; cun Hinnom nelrawn cu a vun zul i Jebus mi fing thlang khan a lan i En-rogel a vung phan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />cun chaklei hoih in aa kuai i En-shemesh a phan, cun khika in Adummim i hung kainak ralchan i a ummi Geliloth ah a kal; cun Reuben fapa Bohan Lung ah cun a vung kal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />cun Beth-arabah fing kha chaklei in a hei tan i Arabah ah a vung kal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />cun ramri cu Beth-hoglah fing chaklei ah a va lan i ramri cu Cite Rili chaklei fonghlei ah a dong, Jordan tiva thlanglei donghnak ah khan. Mah hihi thlanglei donghnak ah khan. Mah hihi thlanglei kam ramri cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nichuahlei, kamah Jordan cu a ramri a si. Benjamin phun nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah an comi ram cu, a velchum in a ramri nih a kulhning in, mah hihi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An innchung khar ning cio ah Benjamin phun khua hna cu mah hihi an si: Jeriko, Beth-hoglah, Emek-keziz,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beth-arabah, Zemaraim, Bethel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Avvim, Parah, Ofrah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khefar-ammoni, Ofni, Geba, — khua pa hleihnih an khuate hna he;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />cun Gibeon, Ramah, Beeroth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizpah, Khefirah, Mozah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Rekem, Irpeel, Taralah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zela, Haelef, Jebus (cucu Jerusalem), Gibeah, le Kiriath-jearim — khua pa hleili an khuate hna he. Mah hihi Benjamin phun nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah an comi cu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Camcawh fung pahnihnak cu Simeon caah a hung chuak, an innchungkhar ning cio ah Simeon phun caah cun; cun an vo cu Judah phun nih an comi chungah khan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah nih a comi hna cu Beersheba, Sheba, Moladah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hazar-shual, Balah, Ezem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eltolad, Bethul, Hormah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziklag, Beth-markaboth, Hazar-susah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth-lebaoth, le Sharuhen khua pahleithum an khuate hna he;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />cu En-rimmon, Ether le Ashan khua pali an khuate hna he;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cun hi khuapi hna velchum i a ummi khuate vialte, Ballath-beer, Negeb i Ramah tiangin. Mah hihi Simeon phun nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah an comi cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simeon phun nih an comi ram cu Judah ram chungah khan aa tel ve. Judah phun vo cu an caah a ngan tuk caah Simeon phun nih cun an comi ram chungah cun vo an co ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Camcawh fung pathumnak cu Zebulun phun caah a hung chuak, an innchungkhar ning cio ah. An comi ram cu Sarid tiang a phan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />cun an ramri cu nitlaklei ah a hung kal i Mareal ah a lan i Dabbesheth i a ummi tivate tiang a kal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />cun Sarid in ramri cu khattelei kamah nichuahlei ah Khisloth-tabor ramri tiang a kal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khika in Daberath ah a kal i Jafia a hung phan; khika in nichuahlei kam zuahmah in a kal i Gath-hefer le Eth-kazin a phan cun Rimmon ah a va kal i Neah lei ah aa kuai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />cun chaklei ah ramri cu aa mer i Hannathon ah a kal i Iftahel nelrawn ah a dong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Kattath, Hahalal, Shimron, Idalah, le Bethlehem — khuapi hleihnih, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mah hihi Zebulun phun nih an innchungkhar ning cio in an comi vo cu a si — hi khua hna le an khuate hna cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Camcawh fung palinak cu Issakhar caah a hung chuak, an innchungkhar ning cio ah Issakhar phun caah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun a ram chungah cun Jezreel, Khesulloth, Shunem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hafaraim, Shion, Anaharath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rabbith, Kishion, Ebez,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Remeth, En-gannim, En-haddah le Beth-pazzez an um;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ramri nih cun Tabor, Shahazumah, le Beth-shemesh zong a tongh hna i a ramri cu Jordan ah a dong — khua hleiruk, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mah hihi Issakhar phun nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah an comi vo cu a si — hi khua hna le an khuate hna he cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Camcawh fung panganak cu Asher phun caah a hung chuak, an innchungkhar ning cio ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ram chungah cun Helkath, Hali, Beten, Akhshaf,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Allam-melek, Amad, le Mishal an um; nitlaklei leiah Karmel le Shihor-libnath a hei tongh i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nichuahlei ah aa mer, Beth-dagon ah a kal i Zebulun le Iftahel nelrawn tongh in chaklei ah Beth-emek le Neiel ah a kal; cun chaklei ah a lan i Jabul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ebron, Rehob, Hammon, Kanah le Sidon Ngan tiang a kal;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />cun ramri cu Ramah leiah aa mer i kulhmi khuapi Tair a phan; cun ramri cu Hosah leiah aa mer i rili ah a dong; Mahalab, Akhzib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ummah, Afek, le Rehob — khua kul le khua hnih, an khuate hna he,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mah hihi Asher phun nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah an comi ro cu a si — hi khua hna le an khuate hna he cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Camcawh fung paruknak cu Naftali phun caah a hung chuak, an innchungkhar ning cio in, Naftali phun caah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A ramri cu Helef le Zaanannim ah a ummi kuhthing le Adami-nekeb le Jabneel in a thawk i Lakkum tiang a kal, cun Jordan ah a dong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />cun ramri cu nitlaklei ah Aznoth-tabor leiah aa mer i khika in Hukkok ah a kal i thlanglei ah Zebulun le nitlaklei ah Asher le nichuahlei ah Judah kha Jordan ah a pal pah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kulhmi khua hna cu Ziddim, Zer, Hammath, Rakkath, Khinnereth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Adamah, Ramah, Hazor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedesh, Edrei, En-hazor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ziron, Migdalel, Horem, Beth-anath, le Beth-shemesh an si — khua hlei kua, an khuate hna he.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mah hihi Naftali phun nih an innchungkhar ning cio in an comi vo cu a si — hi khua hna le an khuate hna cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Camcawh fung pasarihnak cu Dan phun caah a hung chuak, an innchungkhar ning cio ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cun an comi ram chungah cun Zorah, Eshtaol, Ir-shemesh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Shaalabbin, Aijalon, Ithlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Elon, Timnah, Ekron,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Eltekeh, Gibbethon, Baalath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehud, Bene-berak, Gath-rimmon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />le Mejarkon le Rakkon le Joppa changtu ram cu an i tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Dan mi nih an ram cu an sungh tikah, Dan mi hna cu an hung kal i Leshem kha an hung doh i an tei. Vainam in an sam dih hnuah an lak i a chungah khua an sa i anmah thlatu Dan min chuankhan in Leshem cu Dan tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Mah hihi Dan miphun nih an innchungkhar ning cio ah an comi vo cu a si — hi khua hna le an khuate hna cu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Cun ram cu an covo cio ah an i phawt dih tikah, Israel mi hna nih cun Nun fapa Joshua kha anmah lakah vo pakhat an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Bawipa nawl pek bangin a halmi hna khua, Efraim tlangram i a ummi Timnath-serah kha an pek; cu khua cu a ser ṭhan i a chungah khua a sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Mah hna hi tlangbawi Eleazar le Nun fapa Joshua le Israel mi phun hna i an chung cio lu hna nih Shiloh ah Bawipa hmaiah tonnak thlam innka ah camcawhfung khiah in an phawtmi covo cu an si. Cuticun ram phawt cu an lim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Joshua cu a chawnh i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel mi hna cu, ‘Moses sinin nannih sinah ka chimmi himnak khua kha ser hna u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />khika ah timh cianak um lo le hngalh loin mi a that sualmi nih a zam nakhnga; nannih caah thisen phuhlamtu sinin himnak khua an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi khua pakhatkhat ah hin a va zam lai i khua luhnak kutka ah cun a dir lai i khi khua upa hna sinah khan a kong cu a va chim lai; cun annih nih khua chungah cun an luhpi lai i hmun an pek lai i, anmah sinah cun a um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun thisen phuhlamtu nih a dawi ahcun, mi thattu cu a kut chungah an rak pek awk a si lai lo, zeicahtiah a innpa a rak thah cu hngalh lo le hlanah huatnak ngei loin a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun mi zapi hmaiah biaceih awkah a dir hlan le khi caan ah tlangbawi ngan a simi a thih hlantiang cu, khi khua ah cun a um lai; khi tikah mi thattu cu a zamtakmi amah khua le amah inn ah khan a kir ṭhan lai,’ tiah chim hna,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cucaah Naftali tlangram i Galilee ram chungah Kedesh le, Efraim tlangram ah Shekhem le, Judah tlangram ah Kiriath-arba (cucu Hebron) cu an thim hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Jeriko nichuahlei Jordan tiva ral ah Reuben phun chungin tlangrawn ram ramlak i a ummi Bezer le, Gad phun chungin Gilead i a ummi Ramoth le, Manasseh phun chungin Bashan i a ummi Golan kha an thim hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mah khua hna hi Israel mi vialte le an lak i khual a pemmi hna caah tinhmi an si, zeitintiah timh cianak um loin mi a thatmi paoh nih khika ah an zam i, mi zapi hmaiah a dir hlanah cun thisen phuhlamtu kut in a thih nakhnga lo, tinhmi an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Levi chung upa hna cu tlangbawi Eleazar le Nun fapa Joshua le Israel miphun hna i an chung cio lu hna sinah cun an ra i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kanaan ram chung i Shiloh khua ah cun annih sinah, “ Bawipa nih kannih cu umnak khua hna le kan saṭil ca i tlonnak ram pek dingin Moses sin in nawl a rak pek cang,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa nawl peknak bangin Israel mi nih Levi mi hna cu a tanglei khua hna le saṭil tlonnak ram hna hi an vo chungin an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kohath mi innchungkhar hna caah cun camcawh fung cu a hung chuak. Cucaah Levi mi chungin tlangbawi Aaron tefa a simi nih khan camcawh fung khiah in Judah, Simeon, le Benjamin phun hna sinin khua hleithum an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun a taang rihmi Kohath mi hna nih khan Efraim phun, Dan phun le, Manasseh phun cheu hna innchungkhar hna sin khan camcawh fung khiah in khua pahra an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gershon mi hna nih Issakhar phun, Asher phun, Naftali phun le Bashan i a ummi Manasseh phun cheu hna innchungkhar hna sin khan camcawh fung khiah in khua hleithum an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Merari mi hna nih an innchungkhar ning cio in Reuben phun le Gad phun le Zebulun phun hna sinin khua hleihnih an hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa nih Moses sinin nawl a pek bang khan, hi khua hna le an pawngkam i saṭil tlonnak ram hna cu Israel mi nih camcawh fung khiah in Levi mi kha an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah phun le Simeon phun chungin an min in chimmi a tanglei khua hna cu an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Levi phun i a ummi Kohath phun chungah innchungkhar pakhat, Aaron tefa hna nih cun, an co hna, zeitintiah camcawh fung cu annih cungah hmasa bik ah a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah tlangram chung i Kiriath-arba (cucu Hebron; Arba cu Anak pa a si) le a velchum i saṭil tlonnak ram cu an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw khuapi pawng lo hna le a khuate hna cu Jefunneh fapa Kaleb kha a covo caah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun tlangbawi Aaron tefa hna cu mi thattu ca i himnak khua Hebron le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Libnah le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jattir le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Eshtemoa le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Holon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Debir le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ain le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Juttah le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Beth-shemesh le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, — hi phun hnih hna chungin khua pakua cu pek an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />cun Benjamin phun chungin Gibeon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Geba le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anathoth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna le Almon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna — khua pali cu pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron tefa hna, tlangbawi hna cu, an khua a dihlak ah hleithum, an saṭil tlonnak ram cio he, an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levi mi chung i Kohath innchungkhar hna lakah a taang rihmi Kohath mi hna cu, annih an pekmi hna khua cu Efraim phun chungin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Annih cu mi thattu caah himnak khua a simi Shekhem, Efraim tlangram i a ummi le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Gezer le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kibzaim le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Beth-horon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna — khua pali cu pek an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />cun Dan phun chungin Eltekeh le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Gibbethon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aijalon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Gath-rimmon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna — khua pali cu pek an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />cun Manasseh phun cheu chungin Taanak le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna le Gath-rimmon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna — khua pahnih cu pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kohath mi lakah a taangmi innchungkhar hna i an khua kha a dihlak ah pahra an saṭil tlonnak ram cio hna he, an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun Levi mi innchungkhar hna lakah pakhat a si vemi Gershon mi hna cu Manasseh phun cheu chungin Bashan i a ummi Golan, mi thattu ca i himnak khua a simi le, Beeshterah khua le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, — khua pahnih cu pek an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />cun Issakhar phun chungin Kishion le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Daberath le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jarmuth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, En-gannim le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, — khua pali cu pek an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />cun Asher phun chungin Mishal le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Abdon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Helkath le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna le Rehob le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna — khua pali cu pek an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />cun Naftali phun chungin mi thattu caah himnak khua a simi Kedesh, Galilee ram i a ummi, le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Hammoth-dor le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna le, Kartan le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna — khua pathum cu pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gershon mi innchungkhar hna nih an co ciomi khua hma cu a dihlak ah hleithum, an saṭil tlonnak ram cio hna he, an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cun Levi mi a taang rihmi Merari innchungkhar hna cu Zebulun phun chungin Jokneam le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Kartah le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dimnah le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Nahalal le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna — khua pali cu pek an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />cun Reuben phun chungin Bezer le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Jahaz le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedemoth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna le Mefaath le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, — khua pali cu pek an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />cun Gad phun chungin Gilead ah a ummi Ramoth, mi thattu caah himnak khua a simi le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Mahanaim le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Heshbon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Jazer le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna — a dihlak ah khua pali cu pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Levi phun chungin a taang rihmi Merari innchungkhar hna cu khua an pekmi hna a dihlak ah hleihnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel mi hna covo lakah Levi mi khua hna cu a dihlak ah sawm li le pariat, an saṭil tlonnak ram cio hna he, an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hi khua hna nih hin an velchum ah saṭil tlonnak ram hna kha an ngei cio; cuticun hi khua hi a dihlak in an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cu bangin Bawipa nih Israel mi cu an pupa hna sinah pek awkin chiat a sermi ram vialte kha a pek hna. An tei i khika ah um hmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih an pupa hna sinah chiat a rak ser bantukte khan, a kenkip ah dinhnak a pek hna. An ral ahohmanh nih an celh hna lo, zeitintiah Bawipa nih an ral hna cu an kut chungah a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Bawipa nih Israel chungle hna sinah biakamnak ṭha a sermi vialte lakah khan pakhat hmanh pakpalawng ah a cangmi a um lo; an dihlak tein a tling dih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih Reuben mi le Gad mi le Manasseh phun cheu kha a auh hna i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />annih cu, “ Bawipa sal Moses nih nawl an pekmi vialte hna kha nan tuah i nawl kan pekmi hna vialte ah ka bia kha nan ngaih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hi can riamruam nannih nih nan unau hna kha nihin tiang thlahthlam loin nan um i Bawipa nan Pathian nih an fialmi hna cu ṭha tein nan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun atu cu Bawipa nan Pathian nih nan unau hna kha bia a kam hna bangin dinhnak a pek cang hna; cucaah kir cang u law, Bawipa sal Moses nih Jordan tiva khattelei ral ah an pekmi hna nan covo a umnak ram i nan inn ah khan kal tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa sal Moses nih, Bawipa nan Pathian cu dawt awk le, a lam vialte kha zulh awk le, a nawlbia hna kha tuah awk le, amah sinah i bek awk le, amah cu nan lung dihlak le nan thlarau vialte in a rianṭuan awkah nawl an pekmi hna nawlbia le phungbia cu tuah awkah ṭha tein i ralring tuah u,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih thluachuah a pek hna i a kalter hna; cun an inn ah an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun, Manasseh phun i a cheu kha Moses nih Bashan ah covo a pek hna; sihmanhsehlaw a dang a cheu kha cu Joshua nih Jordan in nitlaklei ram ah an unau hna pawngah covo a pek hna. Cun Joshua nih an inn ah a thlah hna i thluachuah a pek hna tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />annih sinah, “Chawva a tampi le saṭil tampi le ngun, sui, dar, le thir le thilpuan tampi he nan inn ah va kal tuah hna u; nan ral hna sinin nan lakmi hranchaw kha nan unau hna he vaa phaw u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cucaah Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu cu Kanaan ram chungah a ummi Shiloh khua i Israel mi hna sin cun an ṭhen i an inn ah an kir. Bawipa nih Moses sinin nawl a peknak thawngin an comi an ram Gilead ram ah cun kal awkah an i thawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kanaan ram chung Jordan tivakam hrawng ram kha an va phak tikah Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu nih khan khika ah Jordan tiva pawngah biakṭheng nganpi pakhat an ser.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Israel mi hna nih, “Zohhmanh, Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu nih Kanaan ram ramri ah Jordan tivakam hrawng ram chung Israel mi hna ta a simi leiphek ah, biakṭheng pakhat an ser,” tiah mi nih an chim kha an theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cu kong cu Israel mi nih an theih tikah Israel mi nih an dihlak in annih kha doh hna awkah Shiloh ah an i pum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Israel mi nih Gilead ram i Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu sinah cun tlangbawi Eleazar fapa Phinehas kha an thlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />cun amah sinah bawi pahra, Israel phun hna chungin pakhat cio, Israel phun hna chung i a lu a si ciomi hna kha an i tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Gilead ram i Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu hna sinah khan an ra i annih cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Bawipa mibu nih an ning piin, ‘Israel Pathian cungah nan tuahmi rawinak hi zeidah a si, nihin ah Bawipa kha doh awkah Bawipa zulhnak khan nan pial i biakṭheng pakhat nan i ser hi a sullam zeidah a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peor i kan sualnak, cu ruang i Bawipa mibu cungah rai a tlun i a thianh hmanh kan i thianh khawh rih lomi kha, kan i za rih lo maw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />cu i nannih i Bawipa sinin i i mer nan i timh? Nannih nih Bawipa cu nihin ah nan doh ahcun, Israel mibu dihlak cungah khan thaizing ah a thin a hung lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Atu cu, nan ram kha a thian lo a si ahcun, Bawipa puan biakinn a dirnak Bawipa ram chungah khan ra ve u law, kan lakah covo i lak ve ko ngat u; sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa tu cu doh hlah u law, Bawipa kan Pathian biakṭheng hleiah a dang biakṭheng sernak in kannih zong kha amah dotu bantuk ah rel chih kan siter ve hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pekchanhmi thil kongah khan Zerah fapa Akhan cu zumhawktlak loin a um i Israel mibu dihlak cungah thinhunnak a tla a si lo mei? Cun a ṭhat lonak ruangah amah lawng kha a thi lo,’ an ti,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu nih Israel innchungkhar i an lu hna cu an leh hna i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa cu pathian hna Pathian a si, Amah nih a hngalh dih, Israel zong nih hngal seh. Bawipa kan doh ruang a si ah maw Amah cung i zumhawktlak lo kan si ruangah maw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />hi biakṭheng hi kan ser i Bawipa sinin a kan pialter a si ahcun, nihin ah hin kan zuah hrimhrim hlah u; cun a cung i khangh thawinak thawinak caah caah siseh, chang thawinak thawinak caah siseh, daihnak thawinak thawinak caah siseh, kan tuah a si ahcun Bawipa hrimhrim nih kan cungah phuhlamnak cu tuah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cu tuahnak ding caah kan tuahmi a si lo, kan tuahnak cu hmailei ah nan fale nih kan fale cu, “ Bawipa Israel Pathian he zei tlaihnak dah nan ngeih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zeitintiah nannih Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna, nannih le kannih karah Bawipa nih Jordan cu ramri ah a ser ko; Bawipa chungah nannih cu covo nan ngei lo,’ an ti hna lai ti kan phan caah kan tuah cu a si. Cuticun nan fale nih kan fale cu Bawipa biak kha an ngolter sual hna hnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cucaah kannih nih, ‘Khangh thawinak caah si loin le raithawinak caah si loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />kannih le nannih karlak ah, kan hnu i kan tefa hna karlak ah biahngaltu a si i Bawipa rian cu kannih nih amah hmaika ah kan khangh thawinak le raithawinak le daihnak thawinak in kan rak ṭuan ve tinak caah biakṭheng pakhat ser u sih; hmailei ah nan tefa hna nih kan tefa hna cu, “ Bawipa chungah covo zeihmanh nan ngei lo,” an ti sual hna nakhnga lo,’ tiah kan ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun mah hihi hmailei ah kannih sinah siseh, kan ciruang hna sinah siseh, chim a si sual ahcun, ‘ Bawipa biakṭheng a keep hi zohhmanh u, kan pupa hna nih khangh thawinak caah si loin le raithawinak caah si loin, nannih le kannih karlak i biahngaltu si dingah an rak sermi hi,’ tiah kan chim lai tiah kan ruah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa kan Pathian biakṭheng a puan biakinn hmai i a dirmi hlei in, khangh thawinak le chang thawinak le raithawinak caah biakṭheng dang sernak thawng in Bawipa lam in nihin ah pial le Bawipa doh cu kan ruat naisai lo!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tlangbawi Phinehas le amah sinah a ummi mibu bawi hna, Israel miphun an lu cio hna nih cun, Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh mi hna nih an chimmi bia kha an theih tikah, an lung a lawm ngaingai ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun tlangbawi Eleazar fapa Phinehas nih Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh mi hna cu, “ Bawipa cungah rawinak nan tuah lo caah, Bawipa cu kan lakah a um, tiah nihin ah kan hngalh; Israel mi hna cu Bawipa kut chungin nan khamh cang hna,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cun tlangbawi Eleazar fapa Phinehas le bawi hna cu Gilead ram i Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna sinin Kanaan ram ah Israel mi sinah an kir i bia kha an rak phorh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun hi kong nih Israel mi kha an lung a ton hna; Israel mi nih Pathian kha an thangṭhat i, Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna an umnak ram hrawh awk i annih doh awk kha an ceih ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna nih cu biakṭheng cu Ed tiah min an sak; “Zeitintiah cu biakṭheng cu Bawipa cu Pathian a si tiah kan karlakah biahngaltu a si caah,” an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Caan saupi hnuah, Bawipa nih Israel mi hna cu an velchum i an ral hna sinin dinhnak a pek hna tik le Joshua cu a upat i a tar ngaingai tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua nih Israel mi vialte an upa hna le an lu hna le an biaceihtu hna le an bawi hna kha a auh hna i annih cu, “Atu cu ka upa i ka tar ngaingai cang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cun nannih nih Bawipa nan Pathian nih hi miphun vialte hna cungah nan caah a tuahmi kha nan hmuh cang, zeitintiah nannih an dohpiaktu hna cu Bawipa nan Pathian kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zohhmanh u, nannih cu a tang rihmi miphun hna kha nan phun cio caah ro ah kan pek hna, ka tei ciami miphun vialte hna he, Jordan tiva thawk in nitlaklei ah Rili Ngan tiang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian nih nan hmaiah a dawi hna lai i nan mit hmuh phak lo tiang a ṭhawl hna lai; cun Bawipa nan Pathian nih bia an kam hna bangin an ram cu nan co lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cucaah Moses phungbia cauk chungah aa ṭialmi vialte kha zulh awk le tuah awkah fek tein um ko u; orhlei ah siseh; kehlei ah siseh pialtak hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nannih nih hika i nan lakah a tang rihmi miphun hna he hin i cawh lo le, an pathian hna min kha chim lo le, cu hna cun chiatser lo le, an rianṭuan lo le an hmaiah kun loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />nihin ni tiang nan tuah bangin Bawipa nan Pathian sinah i bek ko u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zeitintiah Bawipa nih nan hmai in a ngan le a ṭhawngmi miphun hna kha a dawi hna i, nannih cu nihin ni tiangah ahohmanh nih an in celh hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian nih bia an kam hna bangin amah cu an dohpiaktu hna kha a si caah, nan lak i mi pakhat nih thong khat kha a dawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa nan Pathian cu dawt awkah i ralring ngaingai tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nan i mer i hika ah nannih lakah a tang rihmi miphun hna hi nan fonh hna i nan ṭhit nan lak hna i an nu hna kha nan ṭhit hna i annih nih an in ṭhit ve hna ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian nih hi miphun hna hi nan hmai in a ṭhawl lan hna lai lo ti kha fiang tein hngal ko u; Bawipa nan Pathian nih an pekmi hna hi ram ṭha chung hin nan loh hlantiang nan caah rap le thang le, nan hnak i tuknak fung le nan mit chung i hling an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Cun, atu cu vawleicung vialte phung bangin ka kal ve cang lai. Nannih nih nan dihlak in, Bawipa nan Pathian nih nanmah kongah biakamnak a tuahmi thilṭha vialte lakah pakhat hmanh pakpalawng a can lo kha nan lungthin le nan ruahnak in nan hngalh; nannih caah a dihlak in a tling dih, pakhat hmanh a bau lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nan Pathian nih nannih kongah biakamnak a tuahmi thilṭha vialte kha nan caah a tlin bantukte khan, Bawipa nan Pathian nih hi ram ṭha an pekmi hna chung hin an hrawh hna hlantiang Bawipa nih nan cungah thilṭhalo vialte kha a tlunter lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawipa nan Pathian nih nawl an pekmi hna biakamnak kha nan buar i pathian dang hna kha nan kalhnawh i an rian nan ṭuan i an hmaiah nan kun ahcun, khi tikah Bawipa thinhunnak cu nan cungah a alh lai i an pekmi hna ram ṭha hin khulrang tein nan rawk lai,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih Israel miphun vialte kha Shekhem ah a pumh hna i Israel mi upa hna le lu hna le biaceihtu hna le bawi hna kha a auh hna; cun Pathian hmaiah an hung chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih mi vialte cu, “Hi bangin Bawipa Israel Pathian nih a ti: ‘Hlan liopi ah cun nan pupa hna cu Zufrates tiva khattelei ral ah an rak um, Abraham le Nahor pa Terah cu; cun pathian dang kha an rak biak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun nan pa Abraham kha Tiva ral khan ka lak i Kanaan ram chung dihlak ah ka hruai i a tefa cu tampi ah ka ser hna. Isak kha ka pek i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isak cu Jakob le Esau kha ka pek. Cun Esau cu Seir tlangram kha ngeih awkah ka pek, sihmanhsehlaw Jakob le a fale hna cu Izipt ah an vung kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Moses le Aaron kha ka thlah hna i Izipt cu a chung i ka tuahmi in ka hrem; cun a hnuah nannih cu kan chuahpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun nan pale hna cu Izipt in ka chuahpi hna i rili kha nan phan; cun Izipt mi nih nan pale cu rangleng le rangcung ralkap in Rili Sen tiang an dawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Bawipa kha an ka auh tikah, Izipt mi he nan karlak ah muihnak ka chiah i rili kha an cungah ka tlunter i ka khuhter hna; cun nannih mit nih Izipt cung i ka tuahmi kha an hmuh; cun ramlak ah caan saupi nan um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Jordan khattelei kamah a ummi Amor mi hna ram ah khan kan hruai hna; nannih kha an in doh hna i annih cu nan kut chungah kan pek hna i, an ram cu nan lak i annih cu nan hmaiah ka hrawh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Zippor fapa Balak, Moab siangpahrang, cu a tho i nan nih kha an doh hna; cun mi a hei thlah hna i Beor fapa Balaam cu nannih kha chiat serh awkah a sawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Balaam cu ka ngai duh lo, cucaah thluachuahnak an pek hna; cuticun nannih cu a kut chungin kan chuah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Jordan tiva kha nan tan i Jeriko kha nan phan i Jeriko khuami hna le Amor mi hna, Periz mi hna, Kanaan mi hna, Hit mi hna, Girgash mi hna, Hiv mi hna le Jebus mi hna zong nih nannih kha an rak in doh hna; annih cu nan kut chungah kan pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Amor mi siangpahrang pahnih nan hmai in a ṭhawltu hna khuaingal kha nan hmaiah ka thlah; nan vainam in siseh, nan likuk in siseh a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan rak thlawh lomi ram le nan rak sak lomi khua hna kha kan pek hna i khika ah nan um; nan phun lomi mitsur ruang le oliv dum theitlai kha nan ei.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Cucaah atu cu Bawipa kha ṭih u law, amah rian kha lungtak te le zumhawktlak tein ṭuan tuah u; Tiva khattelei ral le Izipt ram ah nan pupa hna nih an biakmi pathian hna kha hlaw hna u law, Bawipa kha bia tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Bawipa biak kha nan duh lo a si ahcun nihin ni ah hin nan biak ding cu i thim u; Tiva khattelei ral ram ah nan pupa hna nih an biakmi pathian hna maw, asiloah, an ram nan umnak a simi Amor mi pathian hna dah nan i thim lai; kei le kan innchungkhar tu nih cun Bawipa kha kan biak ko lai,” tiah a ti
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun mizapi nih cun an leh i, “ Bawipa kha pathian dang biaktak awkah kan hlaw naisai lai lo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zeitintiah Bawipa kan Pathian cu kanmah le kan pupa hna kha sal taannak inn, Izipt ram in a kan chuahpitu le kan mithmuh ah hmelchunhnak lianngan a tuahtu le kan kalnak kip le kan palmi miphun kip lakah a kan zuahtu kha a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />cun Bawipa nih kan hmai in mi vialte, ram chung i a ummi Amor mi hna kha, a dawi hna; cucaah kannih zong nih kan Pathian a si caah Bawipa cu kan biak lai,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Joshua nih mi zapi cu, “ Bawipa cu a rian nan ṭuan kho lai lo, zeitintiah amah cu Pathian thiang a si; nahchuak Pathian a si; nan phungbuarnak siseh, nan sualnak siseh, an ngaithiam hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nannih nih Bawipa kha nan hlawt i ramdang pathian kha nan biak hna ahcun, nan cung i ṭhatnak a tuah hnuah khan, aa let lai i ṭha loin an tuah hna lai i an hrawh dih hna lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun mi zapi nih Joshua cu, “A si hin lai lo, sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa kha kan biak ko lai,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih mizapi cu, “ Bawipa kha biak awkah nan i thim cang ti biahngaltu cu nanmah lila kha nan si,” a ti hna. Cun annih nih, “Biahngaltu cu kanmah hi kan si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah nih, “Hi a si ahcun nanmah lak i a ummi ramdang pathian hna kha hlaw hna u law, nan lung in Bawipa, Israel Pathian, cu i hngatchan tuah u,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun mi zapi nih cun Joshua cu, “ Bawipa kan Pathian cu kan biak lai i amah aw kha kan ngaih lai,” tiah an chawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cucaah Joshua nih khi ni ah mizapi hna he cun biakamnak a tuah i annih caah Shekhem ah nawlbia le phunglam kha a serpiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih hi bia hna cu Pathian phungbia cauk chungah a ṭial hna; cun lung nganpi pakhat a lak i Bawipa hmunthiang chungah a ummi kuhthing kung tangah a bunh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih mi vialte cu, “Zohhmanh u, mah hi lung hi kan cung i biahngaltu a si lai, zeitintiah Bawipa nih kan sinah a chimmi bia vialte kha hi lung nih hin a theih; cu caah nan cungah biahngaltu a si lai, nan Pathian cungah nan hrokhrawl sual nakhnga lo,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun Joshua nih mi zapi cu anmah le an comi ram cio ah a kalter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi thil hna hnuah Nun fapa Joshua, Bawipa sal cu, a thi, kum za khat le kum hra a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cun annih nih Efraim tlangram i a ummi Gaash tlang chaklei ah a ummi amah comi Timnath-serah ah khan an vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun Israel mi nih Joshua nunchung vialte le, Joshua hnu i a nung i Bawipa nih Israel mi caah a tuahmi rian vialte a hngaltu upa hna nunchung cu Bawipa rian kha an ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel mi nih Izipt ram in an hun i kaipimi Josef ruh kha, Shekhem khua i hmun pakhat Jakob nih Shekhem pa Hamor i a fapa hna sinin tangka za khat in a cawkmi ah khan an vui; cu hmun cu Josef tefa hna rothil ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun Aaron fapa Eleazar zong a thi i amah fapa Phinehas nih Efraim tlangram chung i a comi Gibeah khua ah an vui.
  </para>
</usx>
